Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.27,0:00:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,哇噻 兄弟\NWhoa, Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.32,0:00:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,哇呜哇呜 呜呜呜\NWow! Wow! Oooo...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.60,0:00:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈\NHa ha ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.90,0:01:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,呜哇\NWoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈\NHa ha ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.32,0:01:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,呕呜呜呜......\NOww...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.87,0:01:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,呕呜......\NOww!...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.82,0:01:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,呦\NYo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.42,0:01:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,当心！\NWatch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.50,0:01:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你挡我路了 兄弟\NYou're in my way, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.35,0:01:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 好吧\NOh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.55,0:01:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,哇呜......\NWow...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.90,0:01:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.92,0:01:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.32,0:01:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,呜......\NOooo...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.52,0:01:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,呜......\NOooo...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.10,0:01:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈......\NHaha...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.90,0:01:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我还行\NI'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.87,0:01:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？ 你该飞得更快一些\NYou should be faster, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.60,0:01:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 呜......\NWow! Oooo...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.17,0:01:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,呕呜\NOww!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.45,0:01:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真酷啊 兄弟\NIt's cool, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.20,0:01:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,别那样 笨蛋 好嘛\NDon't do that, coot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:01:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们走吧\NLet's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.47,0:02:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你很酷 我支持你 兄弟\NIt's cool. I'm with you, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.90,0:02:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,击掌\NHigh-five.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.90,0:02:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿嘿\NHey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.47,0:02:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我得回去了 哥\NI gotta get back, Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.87,0:02:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,老弟\NLittle bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.50,0:02:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,走之前告诉我一件事\NTell me one thing before you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.92,0:02:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我是怎样死的\NHow did I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.97,0:02:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你中枪了\NYou got shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.70,0:02:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们本可以逃的\NWe could have escaped,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.91,0:02:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但我非要大家回去找蜘蛛\Nbut I made us go back for spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.25,0:02:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们本就该回去\NThen we have to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.30,0:02:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是你的错\NThat's hot your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.47,0:02:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,把这话留给爸爸\NHave that to dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.15,0:02:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们本不该出现在那里\NWe werent even supposed to be out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我被逮住\NI got this caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.47,0:02:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为我违抗了命令\NBecause I disobeyed orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.32,0:02:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那正是你啊  老弟\NThta's just you, little bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:03:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你 哥\NI love you bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.05,0:03:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你小子怎么回事\NThis is going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.62,0:03:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我害死了我哥\NI killed my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.57,0:03:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不管发生过什么 我的余生都要背负着它度过\NNo matter what happens, I have to live with that for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.92,0:03:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我真希望我能做到\NI wish I could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.15,0:03:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我何尝不希望这样...\NI wish I could do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.62,0:04:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,...要是我没有在水下遭遇愚蠢的癫痫发作就好了\N...if I've not of stupid seizure underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.80,0:04:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 谁叫你没戴面罩\NYep, you'd be me without a mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.60,0:04:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那咱就做个测试 看看会发生什么\NLet's test that see waht happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.32,0:04:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么缝线的？怎么缝线的？\NWhat's the stitches? What's the stitches?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.52,0:04:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样吗？哈？\NLike that huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.60,0:04:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,仇恨之火只留下悲伤之灰\NThe fire of hate leaves only the ash of grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.80,0:04:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我母亲以古老的方式哀悼\NMy mother mourned the ancient way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.89,0:04:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,在日食期间目睹儿子的生活\NSeeing her son's life during the daily eclipse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.47,0:04:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,因为光明终归会重现......\NBecause the light always returns...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.60,0:05:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是我的哀悼方式...\NThere's the not me way...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,...还有我爸爸的哀悼方式是 保持沉默 埋头做事\N...and then there's my dad's way, say nothing, keeing busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.12,0:05:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,岛礁族人说 大海能把你净化\NThe Reef People say the sea washes you clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.02,0:05:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,洗去你的罪孽\NWashes away your sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.55,0:06:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你找到了什么？\NWhat do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.27,0:06:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是来收集枪支的\NWe're supposed to be collecting guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.07,0:06:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得这东西没用\NYours I think useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.65,0:06:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,认真点 小子\NFocus, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.60,0:06:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,别让你母亲看到\NDon't let your mother see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.27,0:06:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,借过\NExcuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.37,0:06:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 借过 哈哈 图克\NHey, excuse me, ha ha Tuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.57,0:06:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,快一点\NHurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.10,0:06:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟\NBro.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.97,0:06:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到它了\NI see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.57,0:06:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？\NWhat's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.82,0:06:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,提蕾娅\NTsireya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.22,0:06:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\NWhat are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.85,0:07:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一支AR突击步枪\NThis is an Armalite Rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.30,0:07:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这个就是弹匣\NThis's the magazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.50,0:07:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,还没上子弹\NThe bullets are empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.55,0:07:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,拍它一下\NSlap it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.57,0:07:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,瞄准目标\NBracket.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.72,0:07:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,听到“砰”的一声\NAnd then boom,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.92,0:07:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,它会自动扫射\Nit can just spray.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.72,0:07:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你能用这个杀死大批骷髅\NYou can kill a lot of skeletons with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.15,0:07:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,可参照陶瓷制作\NSee ceramic action.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.22,0:07:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,只要把它们清洗干净并上油 就能恢复如新\NClean them and oil them be as good as new.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.00,0:07:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是我们纳美人的一贯作风 杰克·萨利\NThis is not the Na'vi way,  Jake Sully.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.92,0:07:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们禁止使用金属武器\NWeapons of mtal are forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.17,0:07:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你很清楚 这东西一旦触碰会毒害人心\NYou know this to touch poisons the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.57,0:07:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,伊娃会眷顾我们\NEywa will provide.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.10,0:07:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,哀悼期还没有结束\NThe mourning period is not even over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.80,0:07:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,图克 你应该和家人在一起\NTuk, you should be with your family,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.12,0:07:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,而不是收集这些东西\Nnot gathering these things
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.00,0:07:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你的女人需要你\NYour woman needs you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.10,0:07:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我儿子和祖先们一同躺在礁石里\NMy son lies with the ancestors in the reef.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.07,0:07:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你的家乡\NIt's your home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.39,0:07:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过我会站起来战斗\NI said I would stand and fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.09,0:07:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不能使用长矛对抗武装直升机\NBut I can't fight gunships with spears.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.49,0:07:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们击沉了恶魔船\NWe sank the demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.49,0:07:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,如今 兽皮害怕我们了\NThe thingskins fear us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.77,0:08:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,的确 上次我们很走运 而他们获得了更多的筹码\NYeah, we got lucky, and they got many more chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.30,0:08:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们换来了这些\NWhich we got these.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.25,0:08:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很感激你与我们并肩作战 杰克·萨利\NWe are grateful you stand with us, Jake Sully.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.67,0:08:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要的不是枪械\NIt is not guns we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.30,0:08:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,而是驾驭“天空霸主”托鲁克的“魅影骑士”\NIt is rider of last shadow to ride the great Toruk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.07,0:08:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,就像你当年那样\NAs you did before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.47,0:08:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,当你驾驭野兽 你便成了野兽\NWhen you ride the beast you become the beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.55,0:08:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,而杀戮越多 罪孽越深\NAnd the more blood the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.85,0:08:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会再当“魅影骑士”了\NI will not become Toruk Makto again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.10,0:08:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克·萨利\NJake Sully.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.25,0:08:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你永远是“魅影骑士”\NYou are always Toruk Makto.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.47,0:08:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,来 奥农\NCome, Aonung.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.46,0:08:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,能听得见吗？\NCan you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.92,0:08:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我们能够清晰听到 请讲\NYeah, we can hear you loud and clear, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.10,0:08:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经把残骸里里外外都搜了个遍\NSo we've been through the wreck inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.62,0:08:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还有我们在它方圆400米的区域进行了搜寻\NAnd we searched through about 200-meter radius around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.00,0:09:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,除了我们的同伙 并没有发现任何纳美人尸体\NWe didn't find any Na'vi' body just crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.65,0:09:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧......真不幸\NWell...unluckily.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.95,0:09:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那请继续找 博士\NWell, keep looking, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.12,0:09:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,扩大搜寻范围\NExpand the search radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.77,0:09:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了\NI get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.70,0:09:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 士兵们发现了一种新型藻类\NBut soldiers discovered a nwe type of algae.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.25,0:09:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\NHello.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.65,0:09:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 他已经逃离了那里\NSo, he's got out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.10,0:09:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,还有另一种情况 也许有食腐动物把尸体拖走了\NWe don't know that scavengers could have carried off the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.25,0:09:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不 他逃走了\NNo, he made it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.77,0:09:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,而他就躲在这个区域\NAnd he's in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.57,0:09:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那里只有寥寥几个村庄 只需给我一艘船\NDown to a handful of villages you just give me a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.60,0:09:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我已给过你一艘船\NI gave you a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.04,0:09:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,它现在就躺在此处海底下\NIt's right there on the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.42,0:09:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,还有我的团队\NAlong with my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.60,0:09:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,全军覆没\NAll dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.62,0:09:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你带我到那个鬼地方\NYou brought me out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.37,0:09:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,为了一趟任务 足足飞行了26万亿英里\NTwenty six trillion miles for a single mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.37,0:09:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,跟一个家伙展开殊死搏斗\NA kinetic hard-kill up against one guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.50,0:09:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但我毫无退缩\NI ain't backing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.67,0:09:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 有人在吗\NEveryone is here, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.15,0:09:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回来\NWelcome back！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.97,0:10:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这张弓承载着我祖先的精神\NThe spirit of my ancestors is in this bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.75,0:10:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的力量是什么？\NWhat was our strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.95,0:10:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我能帮你修好它 洛阿克\NI can help you fix it, Lo'ak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.17,0:10:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.37,0:10:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,它已经给毁了\NIt's ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.57,0:10:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我碰过的所有东西都给毁了\NEverything I touch gets ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.72,0:10:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他们从未谈及此事\NThey never talked about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.97,0:10:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,但它就像一个斗牛士 静静地蹲伏在房间里\NBut it was there in the room like a crouching tenador.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.85,0:10:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你永远不会放弃这张弓\NI know you will never give up this bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.87,0:10:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,所以......\NSo...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.55,0:10:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,当它击中目标时 我们别靠太近\NWe're not too close when it hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.97,0:11:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你赞同罗娜尔的观点吗\NSo you agree with Ronal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.85,0:11:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝不会在那女人面前说我丈夫的不是\NI will never speak against my husband in front of that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.10,0:11:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧我在做什么\NLook at what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.30,0:11:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能拿刀去拼命\NNot taking a knife to a gunfight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.40,0:11:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,或接受赠予\NOr to be given.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.27,0:11:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那我该做点什么？\NSo what am I supposed to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.22,0:11:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我跑也不行 打也不行\NI can't run, and I can't fight well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.10,0:11:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 伊娃会给予我们帮助 嗯\NThat's right, Ewya will provide...eh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.05,0:11:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,所以伊娃在哪里？她又在哪里？当我们的儿子......\NSo where was Eywa? Where was Eywa? When our son...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.55,0:11:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克......\NJake...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.12,0:11:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这地方已一无所有\NI'm in this place where I have nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.80,0:11:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,与我无关的族人 与我无关的森林\NNot my people, not my forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.95,0:11:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至连我父亲的弓也丢了\NEven my father's bow is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.97,0:12:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我唯一拥有的\NAll I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.15,0:12:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,就是坚信这是”万灵之母“的旨意\NIt's my faith that this is the great mother's plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.02,0:12:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你还有这个家庭\NYou have this familly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.52,0:12:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你还有我\NAnd you have me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.02,0:12:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我非常的爱你\NAnd I love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.70,0:12:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,总有一天你会让成为真正男子汉\NThere's one day gonna make you the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.37,0:13:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,走 走\NGo, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.30,0:13:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这实在太疯狂了\NIt's just too carazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.25,0:13:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,哇呜......\NWow...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.27,0:13:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,呜......\NOoooo...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,啊哈......\NAha...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.42,0:13:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-噢 -爽\N-Oh. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.47,0:13:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,走走走走\NGo, go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.47,0:13:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,呜哇！\NWow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.72,0:13:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这真是爽到底了 你还好吗\NThat‘s insane, you good?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.61,0:13:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,没毛病 兄弟\NYou're all right, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.52,0:14:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你要凉了\NI thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.12,0:14:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈......\NHaha...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.02,0:14:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,真糟糕 图鲲仍然被驱逐\NIt sucks that Tulkun still outcasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.52,0:14:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.00,0:14:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,明明它救了我们所有人\NAfter saving all our asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.65,0:14:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,也不是\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.15,0:14:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是针对你 但换个角度想 图鲲也经受住了这种考验\NI'm sorry, but by the token way he bears the tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.25,0:14:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,包括所有在战斗中丧生的人\NAll those who died in the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.55,0:14:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他们也经受了这些考验\NThey bears those tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.40,0:14:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 本是你拯救了大家的命\NI'm sorry you should save us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.10,0:14:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 我们是兄弟\NNo matter, we're brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.85,0:14:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我永远的兄弟\NYou're my forever brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.32,0:14:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我输了\NI lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.50,0:14:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,爹\NDad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.57,0:14:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛\NSpider.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.42,0:14:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-等等 备用面罩在哪啊？ -我去找找\N-Wait, where's the spare mask? -I'll go and find.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.52,0:14:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,醒醒\NGet up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.07,0:14:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,快啊 嘿 备用面罩呢？\NHurry up, hey. Where's the spare mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.80,0:14:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我找不到它\NHurry up, hey. Where's the spare mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.81,0:14:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,快啊 嘿 备用面罩呢？\NHurry up, hey. Where's the spare mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.05,0:14:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,备用面罩到底在哪啊？\NWhere's the spare mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.31,0:14:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-你之前有在用 放哪了？-我不知道\N-You used to be there, where is it? -I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.10,0:14:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,快找\NFind it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.72,0:14:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不在这儿\NIt's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.50,0:15:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我它在哪？\NSpeak to me where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.61,0:15:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我找不到它\NI can't find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.22,0:15:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛 嘿 面罩在哪里？\NSpider, hey, where is it？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.70,0:15:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,加油！加油！\NCome on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.42,0:15:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到了 爹\NI got it, dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.27,0:15:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,爹\NDad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.80,0:15:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,赶快\NHurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.70,0:15:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,深呼吸\NBreathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.02,0:15:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,深呼吸\NBreathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.57,0:15:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢来 深呼吸\NBreathe deep and slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.30,0:15:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,深吸 慢点\NDeep and slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.15,0:15:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛 你见好点吗？\NSpider, you okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.65,0:15:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好点了\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.67,0:15:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事了\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.02,0:15:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,没事了\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.82,0:15:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,无赖\NScoundrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.90,0:15:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须要小心点\NYou must be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.34,0:15:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,小心谨慎是我的代名词\NCareful is my middle name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.90,0:15:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,无赖 你以后要小心加倍\NShoundrel, you should be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.55,0:15:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,认真点听话\NPays attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.72,0:15:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,逃罚 逃罚 逃罚\NGet off, get off, get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.45,0:15:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,以后要小心谨慎加小心 认真听话......\NMore and more careful, pay ateention...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.77,0:15:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么吹角？\NWhy blow the bugle?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.50,0:15:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是”风之商人“\NThe wind traders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.75,0:15:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,”风之商人“到了\NThe wind traders are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.40,0:15:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,”风之商人“来了\NThe wind traders are coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.12,0:15:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.00,0:15:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,图克 我们走\NTuk, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.42,0:15:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,快来啊\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.00,0:16:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\NHey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.27,0:16:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧\NLook.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.82,0:16:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧他\NLook at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.82,0:16:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他占不了太多空间\NHe's not gonna take up much room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.82,0:16:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,只要他不惹麻烦就行\NAs long as he's no trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.42,0:16:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,放轻松 咱们走吧\NTake it easy, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.37,0:16:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,图克 琪莉\NTuk, Kiry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.72,0:16:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉 快点好嘛\NKiri, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.72,0:16:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,今天是糟糕的一天\NToday is bad day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.95,0:16:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你们母亲和我已经决定好了\NYour mother and I have come to a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.97,0:17:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛 你明天要回到高营地\NSpider you're back in high camp tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.27,0:17:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.73,0:17:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,“风之商人”会带你回去\NThe wind traders would talke you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.87,0:17:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不 爹
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.90,0:17:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不 爹\NNo, dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.59,0:17:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他不能走\NHe can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.84,0:17:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 蜘蛛\NListen, spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.07,0:17:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,呆在这你只能依靠面罩来生活\NYou can live in a mask day and night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.40,0:17:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想和你们待一起\NI just want to stay here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.40,0:17:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\NI know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.22,0:17:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但这太冒险了\NBut it's just too risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.67,0:17:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这不公平\NThis isn't fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了 我很清楚 你们才是我唯一的家人\NPlease, you're the only family, I've ever know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.15,0:17:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这是对你最好的选择\NThis is what's best for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.65,0:17:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 爹\NBut dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.20,0:17:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我们最好的朋友\Nhe's our best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.34,0:17:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,难道找不到办法了吗？\NCan't we just find a way?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.87,0:17:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,太危险了\NIt's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.72,0:17:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那节电池一旦没电 你也会没命\NThe one dead battery away from being dead yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.90,0:17:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他本该回到自己的种族身边\NHe belongs with his own kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.35,0:17:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,娘\NMom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.70,0:17:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,哪个种族呢？母亲\NAnd what kind is that, mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.20,0:17:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,“天空人”？\NAlien?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.37,0:17:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,粉肤族人？\NPink skins?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.37,0:17:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-琪莉..... -够了\N-Kiri... -Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.30,0:17:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你太讨厌他们了 你眼里只有仇恨 他可是蜘蛛啊\NYou hate them so much, that's all you see. It's spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.37,0:17:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 杰克萨利先生\NPlease, Jake. Mr.Sully.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.85,0:17:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 我不会有任何麻烦的\NI won't be any problem you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.00,0:17:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,爹 这并不合适\NDad, this isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.32,0:17:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛也是这个家庭的一分子\NSpider is part of this family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.12,0:17:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他永远不会成为这个家庭的一分子\NHe will never be a part of this family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.05,0:17:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,由商队来运送他是最好不过了\NThe caravan is the safest way to move him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.92,0:17:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不 拜托\NNo, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.50,0:18:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-他今天就起程 -拜托你不要这样做\N-He's going today. -You can't do that, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.22,0:18:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,就这么定了\NYou must do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.57,0:18:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-不 -够了\N-No. -Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.12,0:18:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一家庭\NThis is a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.64,0:18:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,而不是搞民主 懂吗？\NIt's not a democracy, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.30,0:18:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我恨你\NI hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.10,0:18:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是怎么了？\NThis is why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.25,0:18:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我最好的宝贝女儿\NMy best baby girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.15,0:18:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\NNo...no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.87,0:18:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-没事的  -别碰我\N-It's okay. -Don't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.20,0:18:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的\NIt's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.55,0:18:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-你明白吗？-不\N-You understand? -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.25,0:18:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经失去了哥哥\NI allready lost my beother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.57,0:18:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想再失去任何人了\NI can't lose anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.47,0:18:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们要团结一致\NSo we should stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.05,0:18:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 这是家族的座右铭\NYep, that's the family motto.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.52,0:18:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-简直扯淡  -这不公平\N-It's bullshit. -This isn't fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.42,0:18:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.40,0:18:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 还好吗？这样怎么样？\NHey, all right? How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.93,0:18:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起送他回去\NWe all got together to drop him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.93,0:18:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉\NKiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.22,0:18:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你说你想去看望你祖母\NYou said you wanted to see your grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.60,0:18:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,对 正好我们全家人来一次冒险之旅\NYeah, it will be an adventure for the whole family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.47,0:18:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 也好\NYeah, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.95,0:19:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 待在这儿\NHey, stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.75,0:19:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的约定里只是粉肤男孩一人\NOur arrangement was for the pink skin boy only.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.80,0:19:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不会有任何麻烦的\NIt won't be any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.30,0:19:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你本就是个麻烦\NYou are already trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.07,0:19:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,交易者必须自由行动\NThe trader must move freely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.07,0:19:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能选择立场\NWe cannot choose sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.70,0:19:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,让“魅影骑士”加入商队...\NHaving Toruk Makto on board...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.87,0:19:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,...无异于以这种方式选边站\N...cuts very close to choosing a side in this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.40,0:19:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你搞错了 “魅影骑士”从未登上过你的船\NMaybe you're mistaken. Toruk Makto was never on your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.22,0:19:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果他有登船\NBut if he was ever aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.60,0:19:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话 他的女人会很乐意驾驭他的卫护队陪同飞行\NThen he with his woman would be happy to fly his outriders.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.80,0:19:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,保护商队\Nand protect caravan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.40,0:19:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但愿如此\NI hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.62,0:19:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,如今 灰烬族(芒克万族)的掠夺者变得愈发好斗了\NThe Mangkwan raiders grow more aggressive now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.00,0:20:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那好吧 我接受你的提议\NVery well, I meet you on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.97,0:20:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,启动船只\NStart the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.65,0:20:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,快来\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.57,0:20:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,启动船只\NStart the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.72,0:20:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,启动船只航行\NStart the boat journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.17,0:20:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克\NLo'ak
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.40,0:20:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克\NLo'ak
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.30,0:20:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,提蕾娅......\NTsireya...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.05,0:20:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克 啊哈 嘿嘿嘿\NLo'ak, aha, hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.15,0:20:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,掉转船头\NTurn the boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.05,0:20:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,掉转船头 所有人员就位\NTurn the boat, all in positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.92,0:20:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,请停下\NStop please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.72,0:20:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,迎风一跃而下\NWindward made a jump fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.90,0:20:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,举起来  逆风扬帆\NHold up and raise follow to windward.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.57,0:20:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,提升 提升 提升\NLift...lift...lift
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.07,0:20:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,闪电船平缓驶来了\NLinghtning Ship comes up easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.75,0:21:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,迎风 我们走\NWindward, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.35,0:22:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人都以自己方式表示哀悼\NEveryone mourns in their own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.40,0:22:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说 就是独自待在这里\NFor me, it's being up here alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.35,0:22:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉到他与我同在\NI feel him with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.32,0:22:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟 快看这个\NBro, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.27,0:22:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我在风中听到他的声音\NI hear his voice in the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.75,0:22:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,拿着这个\NHold this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.40,0:22:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,爹 我一直在想\NDad, I've been thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.22,0:22:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？\NEh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.80,0:22:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我应该带上步枪 跟你一起战斗\NI should carry a rifle and I can fight with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.47,0:22:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\NEh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:22:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那是早晚的事\NThat's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.92,0:23:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那你为什么不教我射击？\NWhy not you trained me to shoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.37,0:23:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我清楚自己在做什么\NOkay, I know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.50,0:23:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,通信器呢？我已经跟你说好几遍了\NWhere's comms? I told you five times.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.32,0:23:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你的通讯器在哪里？\NWhere're your comps?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.97,0:23:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这是第一规则\Nrule number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.71,0:23:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你连这个都做不到\NYou can't even do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.45,0:23:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这里\NThat's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.92,0:23:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你能找到它吗？\NWould you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.97,0:23:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 我敢打赌 这家伙是有备而来的\NSure. I promise this guy will imagine in case of bears...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.77,0:23:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 我敢打赌 这家伙是有备而来的\N...if he gets force.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.62,0:23:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,远程控制系统已锁定他们的一举一动\NLong-range controls to these guys when they punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.92,0:23:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的空域例行飞行系统也已经升级\NOur airspace routine flybys enhanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.57,0:23:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,微笑吧 婊子\NSmile bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.57,0:23:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么时候行动？ -今天下午一点五十分\N-When? -13:50 today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.18,0:23:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们掌握了定位坐标\NWe have coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.72,0:24:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 让我们鼓起士气\NLet's man up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.05,0:24:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.97,0:24:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,保持镇定\NHold it heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.40,0:24:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,保持镇定\NHoly heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.77,0:24:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,灰烬部落的首领 瓦琅\NThe sheilk fo the Mangkwan, Varang.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.92,0:24:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,带领灰烬族人在火山地带发动伏击\NLed the Ash People to launch an ambush in the volcanic area.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.47,0:24:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你的电池？\NYour pack?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.87,0:24:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我很好 我还有充足的时间\NI'm good, I got plenty time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.00,0:24:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,终于畅通无阻了\NClear the hinder.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.00,0:25:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克 是灰烬族\NJake, the Mangkwan!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.67,0:25:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,船长 叫他们加速前进\NCaptain, have them speed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.15,0:25:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,加快速度\NHurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.32,0:25:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们动手吧\NLet's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.67,0:25:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,图克 快走\NTuk, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.07,0:25:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\NGo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.77,0:25:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,把他弄下来\NGet him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.92,0:25:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 我们走 图克 快\NCome on, let's go. Tuk, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.95,0:25:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,伊娃主佑\NEywa.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.72,0:25:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 快走\NGo, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.50,0:25:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-保护好你妹妹 听到了吗？-收到 长官\N-You protect your sister, do you hear?. -Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.17,0:25:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,快藏起来\NStay in cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.55,0:26:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛 留着吧\NSpider, keep it！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.32,0:26:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 我的通讯器\NShit, my comms.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.77,0:26:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,和女孩待在一块 去吧\NYou stay with girls, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.40,0:26:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去哪里？\NWher are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.47,0:26:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你应该留在这里\NNo, you should stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.12,0:27:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,快来\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.45,0:27:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,回来\NGet back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.07,0:28:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我即烈焰\NI'm the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.47,0:29:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,走 走 走\NGo, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.32,0:29:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友 朋友\NFrie, frie.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.52,0:29:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们快上去\NLet's go up quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.27,0:29:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛 驾龙离开\NSpider, drive off.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.55,0:29:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 我们走\NCome on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.77,0:29:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,咕噜......\NGulu...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.05,0:29:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,奈蒂莉 奈蒂莉 你收到了吗？\NNeytiri, Neytiri, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.37,0:30:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,该死......\NShit...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.47,0:30:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 慢一点\NGuys, slow off!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.05,0:30:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须跟上 快 快\NWe've got to keep up, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.30,0:30:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克？\NLo'ak?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.45,0:30:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,跳\NJump.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.60,0:30:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,快 来吧 跳！\NGo, come on. Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.65,0:30:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,走走走走走\NGo, go, go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.57,0:30:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 上帝\NOh, god.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.15,0:30:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,大家挺住\NHold on, everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.57,0:30:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.72,0:30:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,挺住 挺住\NHold on, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.62,0:30:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,抓稳 图克\NHold on tight, Tuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.47,0:30:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛\NSpider.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.27,0:30:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉\NKiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.97,0:31:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我的腿\NMy legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.87,0:31:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,拔\NPull.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.17,0:31:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\NYou okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.30,0:31:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Tuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.32,0:31:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,图克\NTuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.30,0:31:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,图克 图克\NTuk, Tuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.65,0:31:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你没事吧？\NHey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.50,0:31:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟 你还好吧？\NBro, you good?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.60,0:31:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,还好\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.09,0:31:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 可爱的姑娘 可爱的姑娘\NI'm sorry. Sweet girl, sweet gril.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.57,0:31:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,真对不起 没事的......\NI'm so sorry. It's okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.50,0:31:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\NJust it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.22,0:31:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不 放开她\NNo, let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.37,0:31:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.20,0:31:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,哥们 飞船在哪里？\NBro, where's the spaceship.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.38,0:31:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.02,0:31:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我的备用物品放在那艘船上\NMy backups stored on that ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.85,0:31:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\NShit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.87,0:31:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉 待在这儿\NKiri, Stay it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.65,0:32:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,看\NLook.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.47,0:32:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,在那里 抓住他们\NThere, get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.90,0:32:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,快撤 快撤\NHurry go! Hurry go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.55,0:32:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\NShit!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.65,0:32:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 快点走\NCome on, hurry go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.02,0:32:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉 快跑！琪莉 快跑！来吧\NKiri, run! kiri, run! come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.72,0:32:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快\NGo, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.07,0:32:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他们来了 快跑 我们走\NThey're coming, Run! let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.50,0:32:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,继续走 走走走走走\NKeep going. GO, go, go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.15,0:32:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉 跑\NKiri, run.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.10,0:32:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这边\NThis way.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.87,0:32:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 图克\NCome on, Tuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.80,0:32:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,跟着我！\NFollow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.70,0:33:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克 洛阿克\NLo'ak, Lo'ak!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.30,0:33:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的怎么回事？\NWhat the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.57,0:33:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,酋长 你看！\NSheikh, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.10,0:33:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,刀！\NKnife!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.45,0:33:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来\NFollow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.25,0:34:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,加油\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.07,0:34:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,图克 手给我\NTuk, give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.17,0:34:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,在那里 快追\NThere, chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.44,0:34:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,图克 他们追来了\NThey're coming, Tuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.69,0:34:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,3,4 往这边\NThree four, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.69,0:34:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 快走\NGo, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.50,0:34:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,加油\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.30,0:34:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,别停下\NKeep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.17,0:34:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,加油\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.85,0:34:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这边 快点\NThis way, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.19,0:34:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep runing, keep runing, go , go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.22,0:34:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,继续跑 继续跑 快快快\NKeep runing, keep runing, go , go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.05,0:34:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 加油\NCome on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.40,0:34:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克！\NLo‘ak!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.40,0:34:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,去他妈的游泳\NFuck the swimming!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.00,0:34:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,别跑\NDon't run.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.67,0:34:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我终于明白了 图克\NI got it, Tuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.44,0:34:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,父亲常提那句话是什么意思了\NTo dad, what's that
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.75,0:34:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们要团结一致\NSo we stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.65,0:34:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不 滚开\NNo, get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.15,0:34:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-所以我们永不放弃？-说得对\N-So we never quits? -That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.66,0:34:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们永不放弃\NSo we never quits.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.50,0:34:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,什么也看不到\NNothing to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.00,0:34:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉！\NKiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.80,0:34:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛.....\NSpider...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.92,0:35:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,图克 抓住我的手\NTuk, Hold my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.50,0:35:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 上帝\NOh, god.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.40,0:35:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉？琪莉？\NKiri?...Kiri?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.80,0:35:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛......蜘蛛？\NSpider?...Spider?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.65,0:35:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住......抓住我的手\NGot...got my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.92,0:35:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 上帝\NOh, god.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.60,0:35:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,重复 收到请回答？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.62,0:35:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,重复 收到请回答？\NEcho, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.02,0:35:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克 快接 小子 回答我\NLo'ak, come in, boy, answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.45,0:35:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你有听到我说话吗？\NDid you have copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.55,0:35:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,图克蒂蕾 图克蒂蕾 能收到吗？\NTukirey, Tukirey, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.20,0:35:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,奈蒂莉 奈蒂莉 收到请回答？\NNeytiri, Neytiri, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.57,0:35:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,图克！\NTuk!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.17,0:35:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,快点游\NQuick swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.22,0:36:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,走\NGo.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.45,0:36:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要去哪里？\NWhere are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.47,0:36:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,加油\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.45,0:36:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我拉住你的手\NI get to your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.00,0:36:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都没事吧？\NIs everybody okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.67,0:36:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\NYou okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.37,0:36:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-蜘蛛 你能走吗？-嗯 我还行\N-Spider. you can go? -Yeah, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.50,0:36:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你们有看到他们吗？\NDid you see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.87,0:36:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.42,0:36:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到外面去吧\NLet's get outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.57,0:36:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我想回家\NI wanna go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.90,0:36:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,图克 来吧\NTuk, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.32,0:36:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在又累又饿 我想回家\NI'm tired and I'm hungry. I wanna go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.45,0:36:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,爹无法知道我们在哪\NDad has no idea where're we.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.32,0:36:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没有通讯器\NWe get no comms.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.07,0:36:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们唯有靠自己了\NWe're on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.15,0:36:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟 我得换一副面罩了\NBro, I've got to exchange a mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.15,0:36:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们该怎么办？\NWhat are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.70,0:36:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 为什么我来负责？\NI don't know. Why am I in charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.10,0:36:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静点\NCalm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.55,0:36:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须做点什么\NWe have to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.27,0:36:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,别响\NShut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.30,0:36:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克？\NLo'ak?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.55,0:36:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧走吧走吧\NGo, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.20,0:36:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得回到船上\NWe have to go back to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.77,0:37:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我们不能回去\NNo, we can't go back to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.00,0:37:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那些家伙就在半途等着呢\NThose guys are between us and the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.47,0:37:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经知道他们的具体位置\NThat's our last known position.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.47,0:37:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,到那时 老爹也会在那里找到我们\NThat's where dad's gonna be looking for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.45,0:37:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟 不行\NBro, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.92,0:37:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只要绕开他们就行\NWe just circle around them?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.17,0:37:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好主意\NIt's good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.20,0:37:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,往哪里走？\NWhich way?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.45,0:37:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,往主边走 来吧 跟着我\NThis way. Come on, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.40,0:37:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你要完蛋了 杰克\NIt's all over, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.00,0:37:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,站住 别乱动\NStay real still.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.82,0:37:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你要找的人吗？\NIs that who you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.42,0:37:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦\NAll right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.62,0:37:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,够了\NEnough!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.54,0:37:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 自作聪明的儿子\NSo smartass son.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.27,0:37:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,把手伸出来\NExtend your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.85,0:37:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,手！\NHands!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.57,0:37:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我.....我明明杀了你\NI...I killed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.55,0:37:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是我命不该绝吧 下士\NI guess I don't die that easy corporal.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.30,0:38:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,帮帮.....帮帮我\NHelp...help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.95,0:38:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁把你伤成这样 下士\NWho hit you, corporal?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.07,0:38:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我的战友\NMy comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.07,0:38:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他们管那些人叫“灰烬人”\NThey call those the Ash People.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.47,0:38:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么个情况？\NWhat's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.95,0:38:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他们砍杀船员 并夺取敌人的脚趾来示威\NThey cut the crew and take their enemy's toes at the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.25,0:38:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,对于那些人来说 这比死更可怕\NThat's worse than death to these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.57,0:38:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你看见他了吗？\NDid you sight him?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.27,0:38:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们都跑了\NKids are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.60,0:38:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,电量还是满的\NThat's fully charged.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.05,0:38:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说他没来得及换面罩就跑掉了\NWhich means he missed his mask change and he ran out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.15,0:38:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,而这就是那些“灰烬人”没能先逮住他的原因\NAnd that's these Ash People don't get to him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.90,0:38:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在赶紧去寻找这些孩子\NWe hurry to go after these kids right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.10,0:38:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不然你以后再也见不到他了\Nor you're never gonna see him then.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.85,0:38:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你在追踪他们吗？\NDo you track them?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.12,0:38:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不在我们的任务范畴内\NThat is not the mission what are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.12,0:38:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你能追踪到他吗？\NCan you track him?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.75,0:38:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在浪费时间 上校\NWe're burning time colone, colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.57,0:38:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,头儿 我们费了九牛二虎之力才抓到他\NBoss, we got him very hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.97,0:39:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不 手铐还是要戴\NNo, the cuffs stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.32,0:39:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,往哪边走？\NWhich way?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.77,0:39:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我怕你会再次被杀\NI fear you'll get killed again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.62,0:39:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 往这边走\NCome on, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.20,0:39:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,河流应该就在前面不远处 快点\NThe river's got to be just up ahead. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.40,0:39:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛\NSpiser!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.15,0:39:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟\NBro!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.75,0:39:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,它没电了\NIt's stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.45,0:39:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办？\NWhat should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.40,0:39:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我的幸运男孩 你会逢凶化吉的\NMy lucky boy, you will turn your luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.67,0:39:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我 慢点呼吸\NLook at me, take slow breaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.22,0:39:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克 你能背他走吗？\NLo'ak, can you carry him?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.67,0:39:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,上来 兄弟 我来背你\NCome on, bro. I'll carry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.97,0:39:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.47,0:40:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们跑到水里去了\NKids ran at the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.17,0:40:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,明智之举\NSmart move.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.07,0:40:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 天啊 不......\NOh, god. No...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.12,0:40:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛......\NSpider...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.25,0:40:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,“万灵之母”我恳求您 快来救救您的天空人吧\NGreat mother save your Sky People first, I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.40,0:40:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,没时间去恳求了 他快要死了\NIt's no time to beg and he's dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.85,0:40:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托\NPlease!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.42,0:40:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你会没事的 兄弟\NYou'll be okay, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.07,0:40:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,深呼吸\NJust breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.20,0:40:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉 琪莉 我们要走了 快啊\NKiri, Kiri, we need to go, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.92,0:40:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉 你确定要坐在那里吗 我们得动身了\NKiri, did you sure sit around there, we have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.47,0:40:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉 你确定要坐在那里吗 我们得继续前进了\NKiri, did you sure sit around there? We got to keep going almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.70,0:40:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定要坐在那里吗 我们得走了\NDid you sure sit around there? We got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.70,0:40:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,她就在那里\NJust over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.77,0:40:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉 来吧\NKiri, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.82,0:41:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,停下\NStop.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.37,0:41:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,快带他过来\NBring him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.20,0:41:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,停下\NStop.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.70,0:41:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\NQuickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.42,0:41:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,停下\NStop.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.92,0:41:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,照我说的做\NDo as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.52,0:41:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,把他放在这里\NPut him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.60,0:41:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,停下 琪莉 你在干什么？\NStop, Kiri, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.60,0:41:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\NWhat are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.97,0:41:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是要干嘛？\NWhat are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.50,0:41:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这种方法 但我从未试过\NI'm know this way, but this way I never tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.45,0:41:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.47,0:41:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,安静点 我不能说话\NBe quiet, I can't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.77,0:42:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克 洛阿克\NLo'ak, Lo'ak!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.22,0:42:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这副面罩 把它摘下\NThis mask take it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.42,0:42:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.02,0:42:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他无法呼吸\NHe can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.32,0:42:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.85,0:43:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉......\NKiri...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.47,0:43:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,别啊 洛阿克\NNo, Lo'ak.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.55,0:43:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,别\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.97,0:43:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不\NOh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.20,0:44:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛！\NSpider!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.85,0:44:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我能呼吸了\NI'm breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.32,0:44:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 幸运儿\NYes, lucky boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.62,0:44:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是\NYou are.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.12,0:44:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我死了？\NI'm dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.10,0:44:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是灵魂世界\NThis is the spirit world.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.27,0:45:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不 伙计 你还活着\NNo, guys. You're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.62,0:45:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我能正常呼吸啦\NI‘m breathing the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.97,0:45:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.55,0:45:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我能正常呼吸啦\NI'm breathing the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.80,0:45:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm breathing the air.\NI'm breathing the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.85,0:45:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我能正常呼吸啦\NI'm breathing the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.12,0:45:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我也能正常呼吸啦......\NI'm breathing the air...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.50,0:45:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我以后再也用不着戴这该死的破面罩了\NI guess I don't need this mask shit anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.12,0:45:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我们都在这 太好了\NYeah, we're here, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.47,0:45:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,耶\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.17,0:45:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,别 别 安静......快停下\NNo, no, quiet...stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.47,0:45:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.47,0:45:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛\NSpider.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.95,0:45:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢你为我所做的一切\NWhatever you did, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.05,0:45:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 该死 后退！\NOh, shit! Give back!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.92,0:45:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,寻找掩护 寻找掩护\NSeek cover! Seek cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.12,0:45:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,小心\NWatch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.40,0:45:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,走\NGo.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.65,0:45:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛！\NSpider!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.15,0:45:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.12,0:46:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,酋长 这里\NSheikh, here!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.00,0:46:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他没戴面罩怎么可能呼吸呢？\NHow is he breathing with no mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.25,0:46:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我没功夫去纠结这问题\NI can't thing about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.35,0:46:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们救人要紧\NRight now we gotta get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.82,0:46:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的空气对天空人来说 不是毒药吗？\NIs not our air poison to Sky People?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.47,0:46:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你每天到底怎么活下来的？\NHow do you still live every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.00,0:47:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这是伊娃的旨意\NBecause it's the will of Eywa.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.17,0:47:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,伊娃？\NEywa?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.30,0:47:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\NYes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.97,0:47:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我现在割了他\NIf I cut him now,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.21,0:47:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得伊娃会不会来救他？\Ndo you think Eywa will come to save him?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.50,0:47:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 帮我把手铐解开\NCome on, get cuffs off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.10,0:47:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,快啊 他要对他动手了\NCome on, they'll kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.42,0:47:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得呢？\NDo you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.87,0:47:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.65,0:47:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这里我说了算 你的"圣母"也救不了你们\NYour goddess has no dominion here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.95,0:47:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.70,0:47:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那把刀借我用用\NThen give me the knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.90,0:47:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你！\NYou!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.25,0:48:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你来示范给我看看 这玩意咋操作\NYou show me how this works.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.97,0:48:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,快示范我看看 怎么使它打雷\NShow me how to make it thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.30,0:48:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 它没子弹 没法打雷\NOkay, it's empty, no thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.90,0:48:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,快使它打雷！\NMake it thunder!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.05,0:48:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了 它没子弹\NOkay, it's empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.82,0:48:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,快点搞！\NMake it quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.20,0:48:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你说了 我已经跟你说了 它没法打雷\NI told you, I told you, it's no thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.02,0:48:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,把最小那个宰了\NKill the youngest one.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.30,0:48:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,别别别别别 求你求你 放过他\NNo, no, no, no, no. Please, please, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.55,0:48:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,放下武器！\NWeapons down!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.65,0:48:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,放下！\NWeapons down!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.77,0:48:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,全部放下！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.82,0:48:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,全部放下！\NLay all down!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.82,0:48:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,现在退后\NNow keep back.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.50,0:48:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,退后\NBack.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.90,0:48:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,继续\NGo on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.50,0:48:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,退远点！\NStep back!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.15,0:48:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,退后 退后\NKeep back! Keep back!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.70,0:49:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,爹\NDad.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.25,0:49:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,萨利 好了吗？\NSully, good?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.32,0:49:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\NReady.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.65,0:49:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们 跟我走\NKids, follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.90,0:49:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那好吧 现在我们慢慢离开这里\NAll right. We gonna slowly leave here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.10,0:49:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,跟紧我！跟紧我！\NFollow me! Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.22,0:49:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不 爹\NNo! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.52,0:49:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不 爹！\NNo, dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.25,0:49:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,爹......\NDad...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.80,0:50:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你是条硬汉\NYou are strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.55,0:50:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,天空人\NSky man.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.80,0:50:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你......示范我看看 怎样使它打雷\NYou...show me how to make it thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.97,0:50:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,还要配上这个\NAnd that's the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.15,0:50:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我来教你\NShow you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.47,0:50:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就瞄准你想打的目标\NNow you take aim what do you want to hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.77,0:50:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,然后像我这样扣动板机\NThen just go like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.72,0:50:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,对\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.22,0:50:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,继续\NGo on!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.97,0:50:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮\NIt's good done.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.17,0:51:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,哇\NWow.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.42,0:51:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在对我没用了 天空人\NI do not need you now, Sky man.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.90,0:51:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,把他绑好\NBind him well.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.90,0:51:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,跪下\NOn our knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.15,0:51:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,准备献祭仪式\NPrepare for sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.70,0:51:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,奈蒂莉\NNeytiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.20,0:51:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,按住她\NHold her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.50,0:51:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,按住她\NHold her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.30,0:51:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,奈蒂莉\NNeytiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.15,0:51:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已帮你拔出箭了 你会好起来的\NWe got you, you'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.02,0:51:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你会没事的 我们就在你身边\NYou'll be okay, we got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.02,0:51:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,麦克斯 准备手术\NMax, prep for surgery！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.02,0:51:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,快 把门尽量敞开\NGo, open more doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.22,0:52:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这些家伙把结系得真够牢\NThese guys know theirt knots.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.60,0:53:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 快点\NGuys, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.87,0:53:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,加油\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.67,0:53:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,走 别停下\NGo, move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.85,0:54:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是那个小女孩干的 来吧\NIt was the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.70,0:54:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,快啊 大家往这边来\NCome on, get in this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.13,0:54:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\NLet's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.55,0:54:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,加油\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.45,0:54:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\NGo.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.85,0:54:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉 快走\NKiri, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.40,0:54:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,酋长！\NSheikh!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.90,0:54:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不见了\NThey are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.90,0:54:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们空中搜索\NWe search by air.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.52,0:54:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,敬爱的伊娃 请帮助我们\NWe need you, beloved Ewya.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.53,0:54:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,别动 孩子\NWe need you, beloved Ewya.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.54,0:54:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,敬爱的伊娃 请帮助我们\NWe need you, beloved Ewya.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.70,0:54:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\NThank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.00,0:54:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,放松点 放松点\NEasing, easing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.02,0:54:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,麦克斯！\NMax!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.54,0:54:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,别动 孩子\NKeep still, child.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.10,0:54:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,别 别\NNo, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.02,0:54:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.57,0:54:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静点\NCalm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.87,0:54:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我的孩子们\NMy children.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.72,0:54:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,奈蒂莉！\NNeytiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.37,0:55:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我的孩子们\NMy children.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.10,0:55:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,闺女 你冷静点\NDaughter, keep calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.80,0:55:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我的孩子们 我的孩子们......\NMy children, my children...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.57,0:55:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪儿？\NWhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.10,0:55:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在哪里？\NWhere are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.75,0:55:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 手脚麻利点 麦克斯 让我进去\NCome on, let's hustle. Max. Get me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.72,0:55:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 好的\NYeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.20,0:55:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们热吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.22,0:55:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们热吗？\NAre we hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.82,0:55:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,非常热\NVery hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.62,0:55:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 最好别穿衣服\NAll right, don't ever wear clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.67,0:55:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须听话 孩子\NYou must listen, my child.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.67,0:55:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,闺女\NDaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.50,0:55:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,再见\NGoodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.20,0:55:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.97,0:55:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我会找到的\NI will find.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.20,0:55:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,回来......哦 不\NCome... oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.02,0:55:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.25,0:55:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.45,0:55:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我来帮你\NLet's help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.60,0:56:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方挺适合休息\NThis is good place.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.55,0:56:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们安全了\NWe're clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.77,0:56:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.90,0:56:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,正好我们该来算算我们之间的账了\NWhich brings us to our unresolved issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.87,0:56:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,可我的箭已经丢了\NBut my arrows has lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.57,0:56:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的刀还在\NStill got our knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.35,0:56:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他们实在太困了\NThey're all kind of tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.52,0:56:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,确实\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.70,0:56:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊 我们最好养精蓄锐\NYeah, better save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.15,0:56:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信那些飞猴不一会就来了\NI trust those flying monkeys will come soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.97,0:56:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那是当然\NYeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.35,0:57:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信现在去做还为时未晚\NYou wouldn't miss much then so late I'll belive that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.25,0:57:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个好孩子\NHe's a good kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.30,0:57:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他确实是个很不错的孩子\NHe's a great kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.27,0:57:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 但即便是这样 我们也不会成为朋友\NHey,but...this doesn't mean we're taking long walks together.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.30,0:57:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有必要 我还是会把你抓起来的\NI'm still bringing you in hand if I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.37,0:57:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,到现在你还是执迷不悟\NAll this time out here you still don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.55,0:57:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这个世界远比你想象中的要深得多\NThis world goes much deeper than you imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.12,0:57:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚你已经见识过了\NYou witnessed it tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.87,0:57:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,和她\NWith her.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.65,0:57:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,还有他\NAnd him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.95,0:57:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不重要\NDon't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.35,0:57:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我是生是死并不重要\NIt don't matter what color I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.00,0:57:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我仍然记得自己在为哪个团队效力\NI still remember what team I'm playing for.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.97,0:58:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经有了新的眼睛 上校\NYou've got new eyes, colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.00,0:58:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你要做的就是打开它们\NAll you gotta do is open them.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.45,0:58:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是灰烬族\NIt's the Ash.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.85,0:58:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,快起来\NGet up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.45,0:58:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 我们得动身了\NCome on, we gotta move.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.53,0:58:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 我们得动身了\NCome on, we gotta move.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.52,0:58:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,快啊 我们赶紧走吧\NCome on, come on. We hurry go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.30,0:58:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,没事了 没事了\NIt's okay, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.67,0:58:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是我们的人 是自己人\NThey're ours, they're ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.95,0:58:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克\NJake.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.57,0:58:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,谢天谢地！\NThank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.50,0:58:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉 图克\NKiri, Tuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.05,0:58:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你们伤着没有？\NAre you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.85,0:58:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是怎么找到我们的？\NHow did you find us?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.02,0:58:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们！\NChildren!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.32,0:58:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,奈蒂莉！\NNeytiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.90,0:59:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈\NMama
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.62,0:59:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 图克\NOh, Tuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.70,0:59:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,图克\NTuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.55,0:59:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉\NKiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.55,0:59:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克\NLo'ak.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.77,0:59:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克\NJake.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.17,0:59:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\NAre you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.72,0:59:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 没事了 我们相安无事了\NYeah, it's okay, we are okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.92,0:59:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,伊诺\NEno.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.47,0:59:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？\NWhat's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.70,0:59:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,什么情况？\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.85,0:59:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,老兄\NDude.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.92,0:59:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 是这样\NOh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.05,0:59:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我能在整片空气中自由呼吸了\NI'm good on the whole air today.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.40,0:59:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,图克 过来这儿\NTuk, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.12,0:59:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉\NKiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.57,0:59:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\NSo good.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.97,0:59:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我超喜欢铁天蓝色\NIron Sky Blue I enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.97,0:59:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在前往城墙的路上\NWe're inbound at the city wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.47,1:00:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你觉得他现在还和萨利在一块吗？\NSo you think he still with Sully?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.32,1:00:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我敢拿奖金打赌\NI'd bet bonus on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.57,1:00:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不是我的首要任务\NThis is not my priority,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.60,1:00:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我的首要任务是建好这座城市...\NMy priority is getting this city well built...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.80,1:00:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,然后把“甘露”送回来抵偿这笔费用\N...and sending back amrita to pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.80,1:00:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 你认为是谁决定了你的首要任务？\NThen who do you think sets your priority?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.87,1:00:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这才是关键所在 伙计们\NIt's the big picture, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.05,1:00:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,下面我有个整体思路与你们分享
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.07,1:00:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,下面我有个整体思路与你们分享\NSo here's a big picture concept for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.07,1:00:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该如何去殖民这个世界？\NHow are we supposed to colonize this world?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.85,1:00:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,假如我们连该死的空气都不能呼吸？\NIf we can't breathe the freaking air?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.00,1:00:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你想找到那个小子 那就得找到萨利\NYou want to find that boy, you gotta find Sally.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.12,1:00:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,然后 按压那里\NAnd press there...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.20,1:00:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 天啊 像这样的还要做多少次\NOh, my god, how many more of these?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.17,1:00:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 没几次了\NHuh, not many more.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.10,1:00:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他们昨天也这么说\NSince they said yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.75,1:00:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这是最新的扫描结果\NHere's the most recent scan that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.65,1:00:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到这些了吗？\NAnd you see this?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.52,1:00:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这些都是菌丝体\NThis is all mycelium.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.52,1:00:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这跟木维网基本没什么区别\NIt's basically the same thing as the forest network.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.42,1:00:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不知何故 这些菌丝侵入了他的身体 并向其全身组织蔓延\NSomehow it colonized him and spread through his entire system.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.07,1:00:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,然后在细胞层面作出了改变\NThen made changes at the cellular level.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.77,1:00:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 你看\NI mean, look,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.65,1:00:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这些菌丝不仅改变了他的血液化学成分\NIt altered his blood chemistry,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.07,1:00:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,还有他的神经系统 他的肺......\Nhis nervous system, his lungs...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.85,1:00:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你能把菌丝取出来吗？\NCan you get it out?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.62,1:00:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 这是内共生体\NNo, it's an endosymbiont.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.30,1:00:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们认为他们是相互依存的\NWe think they're keeping each other alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.85,1:01:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦我们尝试取出 他就会没命\NThey could kill him if we even try.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.02,1:01:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,但你看 他活着的时候 身体很棒\NBut look, when he's alive, he's healthy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.75,1:01:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这未尝不是好事\NMaybe this is good things.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.55,1:01:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是好事\NGood things.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.35,1:01:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你想想看 要是RDA实验室能进行反向工程会怎样？\NWhat if the rda labs could reverse engineer?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.62,1:01:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,再有 要是地球上的每个人...\NWhat if every human being on earth...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.54,1:01:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,...都能不戴面具在这里生活呢？\Ncould live here without a mask?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.94,1:01:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,...都能不戴面具在这里生活呢？\Ncould live here without a mask?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.95,1:01:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,...都能不戴面具在这里生活呢？\Ncould live here without a mask?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.62,1:01:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这个嘛 杰克.....\NAh, Jake...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.72,1:01:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你还有其他想法吗？\NIs there something else?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.00,1:01:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,坐\NSit.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.72,1:01:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计\NHey, bud!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.17,1:01:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.32,1:01:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你别动 别动 没事的\NHold still, hold still, you're fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.72,1:01:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样？\NHow?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.87,1:01:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,看看哪里\NLook at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.65,1:01:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么？\NWhat is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.15,1:01:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他头上长出了一个葫芦\NIt's grown a hulu.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.45,1:01:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他头上长出了一个葫芦\NIt's grown a hulu.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.47,1:01:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他头上长出了一个葫芦\NIt's grown a hulu.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.22,1:01:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\NWait.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.92,1:01:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.70,1:01:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 是的\NOh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.65,1:02:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,万灵之母\NGreat mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.12,1:02:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,您在吗？\NAre you there?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.20,1:02:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,请......倾听我细小的声音\NPlease...hear my small voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.70,1:02:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾在森林里向您祈祷拯救我的朋友\NI prayed to you in the forest to save my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.70,1:02:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我满怀虔诚祈祷您\NI prayed so hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.15,1:02:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,可你没有来\NBut you didn't come.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.95,1:02:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你没回应 所以我只好自己解决\NYou didn't answer, so I had to do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.07,1:02:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道当时是怎么恳求的\NI don't know how I asked?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.17,1:02:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked the roots to help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.20,1:02:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我恳求树根给予我帮助\NI asked the roots to help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.14,1:02:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't ever remember how.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.15,1:02:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我完全记不起来是怎么做到的\NI don't ever remember how.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.65,1:02:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,求你 别\NPlease, on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.20,1:02:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,别 别把我拒之门外\NNo, don't shut me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.60,1:02:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我那时为什么会这样做？\NWhy am I like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.25,1:02:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我又是怎么把这些事情做到的？\NHow am I doing these things?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.92,1:02:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,请跟我说说话吧\NPlease just talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.30,1:02:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,别 别 拜托 拜托了\NNo, no, please, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.80,1:02:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不要......\NNo...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.40,1:03:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉 你是怎么做到的？\NKiri, how did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.77,1:03:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,伊娃从来没有找过我\NEywa never came to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.92,1:03:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉过你 我不知道我是怎么做到的\NI told you I don't know how I did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.85,1:03:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,喝点水吧 琪莉\NDrink water, Kiri.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.27,1:03:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我的孩子 你曾被你生母的手轻抚过\NMy child, you were touched by the old mother's hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.62,1:03:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这事从你出生之日起我们就已经知道\NThis we have known since you were born.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.95,1:03:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你有事瞒着我\NThere is something you're hiding.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.55,1:03:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我一辈子都有这种感觉 就告诉我真相吧\NI have felt it my whole life, just tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.87,1:03:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你们了\NPlease.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.52,1:03:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉她吧\NTell her.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.20,1:03:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是时候了\NIt is time.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.72,1:03:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我的孩子\NMy child.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.00,1:04:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,其实你并没有父亲 ......琪莉\NYou do not have a father...Kiri.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.50,1:04:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.82,1:04:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你的......\NYour...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.92,1:04:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你的亲生母亲是格蕾丝博士的化身\NYour real mother by Dr.Grace's avatar.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.22,1:04:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And when she was pregnant, Norm ran some tests.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.25,1:04:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,她怀孕的时候 诺姆曾做了一些测试\NAnd when she was pregnant, Norm ran some tests.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.05,1:04:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Result shows you was a prrt...parthenogenetic birth.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.07,1:04:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,结果显示你是......你是单性生殖的产物\NResult shows you was a prrt...parthenogenetic birth.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.45,1:04:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你与阿凡达的基因完全相同\NAnd you're genetically identical to the Avatar.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.37,1:04:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说你真的没有父亲\NThere literally is no father.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.25,1:04:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我是个克隆人？\NI'm a clone?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.20,1:04:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,听着孙女 此乃母神之旨意也\NGranddaughter it was the will of Eywa.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.05,1:04:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,当梦行者的躯体趟在万灵之母的怀抱时\NWhen the dream walker's body lay here in the great mother's arms.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.72,1:04:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那时 已悄然播下一颗种子\NA seed was planted.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.52,1:04:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,真可怕\NThat really sucks.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.94,1:04:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,让我感觉自己更像个怪物\NThat makes me even more of a freak.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.87,1:05:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的 孙女\NNo, greanddaughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.22,1:05:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你是神明的孩子\NYou are Eywa's child.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.60,1:05:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你是什么\NI don't care how it happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.80,1:05:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你都是我宝贝女儿\NYou're my baby girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.42,1:05:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你唯一依靠的父亲\NAnd I'm the only father you'll ever need.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.60,1:05:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我真的那么特别\NIf I am so special.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.05,1:05:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那为什么伊娃对我充耳不闻？\NWhy does Eywa fold her ears to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.27,1:05:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我们也不知为什么\NLook, we don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.92,1:05:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但你被她拒之门外\NBut you're locked out from her.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.67,1:05:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这是某种防火墙\NIt's some kind of firewall.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.90,1:05:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 甚至设置了加密\NYeah, even set encrypted.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.27,1:05:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你试图强行入侵 它的防御反制就越强\NThe harder you try to break in, the harder it fights back.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.87,1:05:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,伊娃给你指引了一条路\NEywa has a path for you though.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.50,1:05:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管她选择了隐瞒\NThough she chooses to conceal it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.37,1:05:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,但你一定要相信她\NYou must trust in her.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.40,1:05:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定要寻根问底\NI have to find out what it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.34,1:05:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 你必须停止追问\NNo, you have to stop asking.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.32,1:05:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 你必须停止追问
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.80,1:06:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉 你要是要是要是尝试再次连接 你可能会没命\NKiri, if if if you try to connect again, you could die.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.20,1:06:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,在水下干这事会危及你的生命\NYou do it underwater and you will die.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.65,1:06:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦ODA成功抓获他 他就不能待在这\NHe can't stay here if the ODA gets him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.87,1:06:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们俩从不阻拦他\NWe both never stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.60,1:06:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,要是他严重危及百姓以及万物\NIf he so dangerous to the people to everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.12,1:06:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们只好亲手灭了他\NWe are just kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.62,1:06:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他可是蜘蛛啊\NIt's spider.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.15,1:06:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他会站在我们这边 和我们一同去岛礁\NHe'll come with us, he'll come to the reef.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.17,1:06:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,到了那边 我们就能保护他\NWe can protect him there.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.40,1:06:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,魅影骑士 别回头！\NToruk makto, don't look back!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.05,1:06:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 亲爱的\NCome on, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.95,1:06:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这样的\NIt's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.90,1:06:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,既然你决定了\NIt is decided.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.05,1:06:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,第30小组 让他们嗨起来开始行动\N30th team, get them up getting.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.40,1:07:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,把我送进“驱乐捕”\NGet me in the Club.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.37,1:07:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,十分钟后 把我连同火箭一起送进“驱乐捕”\NGet me in the Club with the rocket ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.70,1:07:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,继续前进！\NStill go!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.80,1:07:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,瞄准！\NAim!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.52,1:07:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,侥幸得分！\NLucky shot!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.65,1:07:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,她姨妈来了 呜呼哀哉\NShe's bleeding out.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.02,1:08:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,新的恶魔船比以前的恶魔船体型更大了\NA new demon ship has come bigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.37,1:08:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,越来越多的图鲲惨遭杀害\NMore and more Tulkun have been killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.71,1:08:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 兄弟\NI'm so sorry, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.20,1:08:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克·萨利\NJake Sully.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.22,1:08:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这个图鲲族的叛徒正在煽动年轻的公鲲\NThe Tulkun of outcast it stirring up the young bulls.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.37,1:08:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的图鲲已召开会议对他进行裁决\NOur Tulkuns have called for a council to decide about him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.55,1:08:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你们必须休息一下\NYou must rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.92,1:08:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be removed, see me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.95,1:08:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这处伤口必须要清理 来我这一趟\NThis must be removed, see me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.67,1:08:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们 孩子们跟我来\NKids, kids come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.35,1:08:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,停 我是认真的\NStop, I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.20,1:08:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,等我头发长得足够长时\NWhen it grows long enough,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.25,1:08:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我要拥有属于自己的伊鲁(坐骑)\NI'm gonna get my own Ilu.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.97,1:08:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,想得美！\NGet knotted!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.64,1:08:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要一头非常小的坐骑\NYou need a very small Ilu.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.20,1:08:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,等着瞧吧 我会拥有专属的水上飞机\NJust you watch, I'll get my own Skimmer.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.77,1:08:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,到时我会去战斗\NThen I'll be to fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.50,1:08:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那你的女儿最近还好吗？\NSo how is  your daughter?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.25,1:08:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你的混血女儿...\NYour half blood daughter...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.47,1:09:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,...没有受过训练\N...with no training.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.00,1:09:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,扛住\NHolding up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.89,1:09:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,她却做了连酋长都做不到的事\NHas done what no sheikh could do.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.60,1:09:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么资格去质疑伊娃的旨意？\NWho are you to question the will of Eywa?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.34,1:09:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-我是酋长  -那就当好你的酋长\N-I'm a sheikh.  -Then be sheikh.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.72,1:09:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,看来敷草药也是白搭\NThese herbs do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.97,1:09:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我在家乡的森林里愈合速度更快\NI at my forest heal faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.60,1:09:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫你休息 你不休息\NI tell you to rest, you do not rest,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.97,1:09:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,反而怪我的草药不好\Nthen you blame my herbs.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.80,1:09:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,别乱动\NHold still.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.02,1:09:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你个无可救药的女人\NStupid woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.42,1:09:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,酋长 说话放尊重点\NCareful, sheikh.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.89,1:09:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,否则我会忘记你肚里有孩子的事\NOr I may forget that you are with child.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.75,1:09:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,图鲲长老发话了\NThe matriarch has spoken.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.75,1:10:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,她说 被驱逐者一再违抗规则\NShe says the outcast continues to defy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.85,1:10:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,图鲲族之道 禁止一切的杀戮行为\NThe Tulkun way all killing is forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.42,1:10:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他曾因此受到驱逐\NHe was outcast for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.82,1:10:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,如今他重蹈覆辙\NBut he has done it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.26,1:10:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这个被驱逐者袭击了恶魔船\NThe outcast attacked the demon ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.87,1:10:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,给我们的族人带来了灾难\NBringing death to our people.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.80,1:10:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,“魅影骑士”之子也因此而死\NEven the son of Toruk Mokto.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.50,1:10:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,爹 他们不能把责任推卸给帕亚坎\NDad, they can't blame Payakan on that.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.07,1:10:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\NI know.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.22,1:10:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,长老说 他一直在搞破坏\NShe says, he continues to disrupt.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.75,1:10:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,企图把我们年轻一代引入歧途\NSplitting bad ideas among our young.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.65,1:10:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,一派胡言\NIt's bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.57,1:10:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他说谎\NIt's not true.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.32,1:10:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,她还说 他在这只会害死更多的人\NShe says, he will only bring more death.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.12,1:10:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,爹 你为什么不说句话？\NDad, why don't you say something?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.52,1:10:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了 你就说几句吧\NJust say something, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.00,1:10:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,长老说 被驱逐者不许待在这片海域\NShe says, the outcast may not stay in these waters.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.56,1:10:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他必须远离这里...\NHe must go far...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.90,1:11:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,...到一个没人知道的地方\N...where his song cannot be heard exile for life.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.72,1:11:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,终身流放\NExile for life.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.76,1:11:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这不公平\NIt's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.20,1:11:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那就这么定吧\NYou just decided.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.32,1:11:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们永别了各位\NIhr werdet mein I ied nie wieder horen.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.82,1:11:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们永别了各位\NIhr werdet mein Lied nie wieder horen.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.02,1:11:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,别走\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.75,1:11:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,帕亚坎\NPayakan.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.22,1:11:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟 求你 别走\NPayakan, please, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.97,1:11:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,帕亚坎......\NPayakan...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.10,1:11:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这是......这是不对的 这是不对的\NThis is... this is wrong, this is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.05,1:11:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你别在这里闹事\NYou do not speak here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.75,1:11:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.32,1:11:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,帕亚坎曾经为我们而战\NPayakan fought for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.82,1:11:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他曾帮过我们 对吗？\NHe fought for us, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.15,1:11:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克\NLo'ak.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.62,1:11:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,还救了她一命\NHe saved her life.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.87,1:11:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你别在这里闹事\NYou do not speak here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.82,1:11:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他被猎杀......\NHe defended...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.84,1:11:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这是会议通过的\NThis is council passed.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.40,1:11:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,也是长老们的意思\NThe elders have spoken.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.50,1:11:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,图鲲族正在被追捕\NThe Tulkun are being hunted.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.12,1:11:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在劫难逃\NThey have died.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.62,1:11:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克 够了\NLo'ak, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.10,1:11:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不！\NNo!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.15,1:11:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克说的对\NLo'ak speaks the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.52,1:11:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不！\NNo!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.05,1:11:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,女儿！\NDaughter!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.82,1:11:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,帕亚坎是个英勇战士\NPayakan is a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.60,1:12:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他比你们英勇多了\NHe fought for us more than you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.87,1:12:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,比你 比在座各位都英勇\NMore than you, more than any of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.42,1:12:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他为了我们而战\NHe fought for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.55,1:12:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.57,1:12:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,叫他坐下\NLet him sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.30,1:12:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克 别说了\NLo'ak, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.15,1:12:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,快给我拿下他 战士们\NTake him, come on warriors.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.82,1:12:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉 回家\NKiri, go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.57,1:12:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,爹\NDad.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.07,1:12:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,听他的话\NListen to hom.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.57,1:12:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,会议还没开完呢\NWe are in council.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.17,1:12:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须跟我回家\NYou must go home with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.40,1:12:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我\NLet me go.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.87,1:12:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你要干什么？\NWhat are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.87,1:12:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你从来都不支持我\NYou never stand up for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.62,1:12:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,保持冷静\NKeep calm.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.60,1:12:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 我们走\NCome on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.87,1:12:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们继续开会\NCouncil continues.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.97,1:12:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是在抗命\NWe're in war.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.20,1:12:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你明白吗？\NYou understand that?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.70,1:12:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你不服从命令 有人就会没命\NIf you disobey orders, people get killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.57,1:12:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 蜘蛛 我们客在他乡\NListen, spider here,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.66,1:12:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要尽量保持低调\Nwe'll try to keep a low profile.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.37,1:12:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,但那个混账就在外面\NBut that rogue is out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.65,1:12:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他在煽动年轻公鲲\NHe's stirring up the young bulls.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.12,1:12:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他要带领整个RDA来对付我们\NHe was gonna bring the whole RDA down on us.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.35,1:12:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要他走\NYou want him gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.85,1:12:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你才什么都不说\NThat's why you didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.55,1:12:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上 他跟你一样就是个冒失鬼\NHe's a loose cannon, he's just like you in fact.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.42,1:12:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是你当初去找他\NIf you hadn't gone to see him at that time.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.10,1:12:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是你违抗命令\NIf you hadn't disobeyed orders,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.50,1:12:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你哥他就不会......\Nand your brother still could be...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.75,1:13:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是我的错\NThat wasn't my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.55,1:13:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有\NI'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.75,1:13:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是我的错！\NThat‘s not my fault!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.70,1:13:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克！\NLo'ak!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.35,1:13:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,去看看吧 杰克\NGo to see, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.40,1:13:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不然你会失去另一个儿子\NOr you will lose another son.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.92,1:13:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我没什么可跟他说的\NI've got nothing to say to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.17,1:13:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不要责怪洛阿克\NDo not blame Lo'ak.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.62,1:13:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你说过你能保护这个家庭\NYou said you could protect this family.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.90,1:13:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你能做到的\NThat's you could do.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.42,1:13:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我们在这里会很安全\NYeah, I thought we woulld be safe here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.45,1:13:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的儿子死了 杰克\NOur son is dead, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.15,1:13:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,是我错了吗？\NI was wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.70,1:14:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要我说什么？\NWhat do you want me to say?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.15,1:14:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我为这个家所做的每个决定都是错的吗？\NThe every decision that I made for this family is wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.20,1:14:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子是我杀死的吗？\NI killed our son?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.82,1:14:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,但事到如今 我们依旧在这个地方...\NAnd still we are here in this place...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.07,1:14:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,...藏匿着这个“粉肤人”\N...hiding this pink skin.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.92,1:14:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这个外星人\NThis alien.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.90,1:14:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我必须在我的家人和“粉肤人”之间做选择的话\NIf I had to choose between my family and a pink skin.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.92,1:14:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我会马上宰了他\NI would kill him right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.32,1:14:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,停步 停步 停步\NStop, stop, stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.90,1:14:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能为么做 你不能这么做\NYou're not doing this, you're not doing this.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.07,1:14:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经在家人和“粉肤人”之间做过一次选择了\NYou already chose between your family and a pink skin ones.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.00,1:14:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,记得吗？\NRemember?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.20,1:14:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能像这个婴儿活在仇恨中\NYou cannot live like this baby in hate.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.00,1:14:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我恨他们 杰克\NI hate them, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.25,1:14:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我恨他们\NI hate them.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.75,1:14:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我恨他们\NI hate them.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.22,1:14:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我恨他们那粉色的手\NI hate their pink little hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.00,1:14:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我恨他们脑瓜里的疯狂\NI hate insanity in their minds.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.67,1:15:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我是个人类\NI'm a human.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.52,1:15:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,在你心里\NInside.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.02,1:15:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你恨我吗？\NYou hate me?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.25,1:15:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我对你来说 永远是个异类\NI'll always be an alien to you won't
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.25,1:15:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,无论多久我都在活在这副皮囊里\NI doesn't matter how long I live in this skin.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.67,1:15:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那你恨孩子们吗？\NYou hate your children?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.02,1:15:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他们用着外星人的手\NWith their alien hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.37,1:15:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不恨\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.15,1:15:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你感到耻辱吗？\NAre you ashamed?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.65,1:15:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你感到耻辱吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.35,1:15:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,每次他们都犯错 每次犯错都不同\NEvery time they make a mistake, every time they're different.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.75,1:15:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那是因为他们内心的人性 对吧？\NThat's because of the human inside them, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.60,1:16:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起......\NI'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.22,1:16:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,眼下我们一定要坚强起来\NWe have to stand strong right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.95,1:16:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这个家是我们精神的堡垒 心灵的港湾\NThis family is our fortress and our harbour.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.62,1:16:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,人们说当你开始接触钢铁时\NThe people say that when you touch steel,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.87,1:16:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,毒药悄然渗入你的心\NThe poison seeps into your heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.87,1:17:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克！\NLo'ak!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.05,1:17:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟\NBrother.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.87,1:17:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克\NLo'ck.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.15,1:17:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不要轻生 要留住青山 老弟\NStay in this life, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.62,1:17:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要你\NWe need you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.85,1:17:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们爱你\NWe love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.65,1:17:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你身上拥有过人之处\NYou have greatness in you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.92,1:17:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,先人的力量凝聚于此\NThe strength of the ancestors is here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.14,1:17:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,弓坏了能修好\NA bow can be fixed.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.62,1:18:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好 好\NGood, good.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.22,1:18:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,开始验货\NA moment to link.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.02,1:18:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\NGood!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.05,1:18:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈\NHaha.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.25,1:18:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈\NHaha
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.67,1:18:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧\NGo.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.97,1:18:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你能与她相通吗？\NYou feel her?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.25,1:18:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 是的\NOh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.80,1:18:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我有鳍了\NI got fins.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.15,1:18:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 你有鳍了\NYes, you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.17,1:18:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,哇......\NWhoa...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.60,1:18:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,呜......\NOooo...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.20,1:18:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,胆子肥点 去作死吧\NGo, fucking way.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.15,1:19:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是他们叫我这样做的 他们叫的\NThey call like this, they call.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.30,1:19:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这个人 有人认识吗？\NStranger, does anyone know?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.80,1:19:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他们叫的\NThey call.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.37,1:19:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们在浪费时间 上校\NI think we're wasting our time, colonel.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.92,1:19:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他们什么都不知道\NThey can't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.92,1:19:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,或者他们认识呢\NOr they know.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.67,1:19:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,只是不肯说而已\NIt's just that not talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.72,1:19:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有一招 但有点极端\NWe got one more play but it's radical.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.15,1:20:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住他了！\NCatched him!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.93,1:20:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你还记得我吗？我请你吃过饭呢\NDo you remember me? I invited you to have dinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.35,1:20:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,去你的\NScrew you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.65,1:20:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 哇 哇\NWow wow wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.80,1:20:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,滚一边去！\NGet out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.10,1:20:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,制住他\NHold him!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.70,1:20:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我想见你们酋长\NI want to see meet your sheikh.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.35,1:20:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你把这个白痴带回去\NYou take this idiots out here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.90,1:20:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿\NHey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.30,1:20:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,没必要这样干 我认得你了\NNo need to do that, I got my eye on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.52,1:20:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,酋长！\NSheikh!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.55,1:20:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,瓦琅！\NVarang!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.37,1:21:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你野心很大 我能满足你想要的一切\NI'll get you as many as you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.25,1:21:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？天空人\NWhat's your name? Sky man.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.22,1:21:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,夸里奇\NQuaritch.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.30,1:21:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,迈尔斯·夸里奇 上校\NColonel Miles Quaritch.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.67,1:21:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你敢再用那支家伙碰我 我就灭了你们\NYou touch me with that thing again, I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.45,1:21:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你杀不了任何人\NYou will kill no one.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.50,1:21:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？\NReally?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.75,1:21:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,听我命令 马上送他去领盒饭\NI'm gonna beg the differ drop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.42,1:22:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 该死\NOh, heck.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.77,1:22:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,勇气\NCourage.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.40,1:22:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你会是下一个小甜点\NYou'll be next cupcake.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.42,1:22:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,只是当心你现在意欲何为\NJust be careful about what you want to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.72,1:22:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,来\NCome.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.35,1:22:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到里面谈谈\NWe will talk inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.20,1:22:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是要干什么？头儿\NWhat will you do, boss?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.42,1:22:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 确实\NBy George,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.90,1:22:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是\Nthe thing is,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.52,1:22:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人都不愿跟我说真话\Neveryone's lying to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.27,1:23:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说\NThey say that,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.55,1:23:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你能让石头道出真相\Nyou can make stone speak the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.00,1:23:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你在寻找另一个像你一样的天空人\NYou seek a man the other man like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.30,1:23:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他跟我不像\NNot like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.77,1:23:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,现在他成了叛徒\NNow he's a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.77,1:23:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那他就得死\NThen he must die.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.65,1:23:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但我会帮你找到这个人\NBut I'm gonna help you find this man.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.82,1:23:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,还有你要寻找的这个人\NAnd the other you seek.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.97,1:23:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,现在他能呼吸空气了\NHe's can breather now.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.02,1:23:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,首先 我得看看你的灵魂\NFirst I must see your soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.75,1:23:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.95,1:23:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\NBe still.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.92,1:23:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\NBe still.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.32,1:24:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这劲头也太猛了 见鬼\NThat's so strong shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.05,1:24:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是......\NThis is...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.70,1:24:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这个世上最纯洁的东西\Nit's only pure thing in this world.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.97,1:25:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire came from the mountain when I was still little.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.00,1:25:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,当我还很小的时候 一场突如其来的山火\NThe fire came from the mountain when I was still little.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.40,1:25:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,烧毁了我们的森林\NBurnt our forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.17,1:25:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,夺走了我们的一切\NIt took everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.65,1:25:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的族人当时忍饥挨饿\NMy people were starving,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.30,1:25:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他们为此哭泣\Nthey cried for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.32,1:25:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,可是伊娃始终没来\NBut Eywa did not come.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.40,1:25:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,于是我接近火焰\NSo I went to the fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.67,1:25:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,并掌握了它的运作方式\NAnd I learned it, its way.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.95,1:25:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我即烈焰 烈焰\NI am the fire, fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.07,1:25:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,依靠我的力量我的族人变得强大\NBy my hand my people grow strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.37,1:25:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不会坐而待毙\NWe do not lies dow and die.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.35,1:26:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就是因为这样 她选择了背叛我们\NJust because it was turns her back on us.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.70,1:26:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也要选择背叛伊娃\NWe turn our back on Eywa.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.10,1:26:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,软弱的母亲就配软弱的孩子\NA weak mother for weak children.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.17,1:26:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不会吮吸软弱的胸脯\NWe do not suck in the breast of weakness.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.60,1:26:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,哇\NWow.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.22,1:26:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,唯有真话会从你口中说出来\NOnly true words will come from your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.05,1:26:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你拥有强大的心脏 无所畏惧\NYou have a strong heart, no fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.32,1:26:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不太好吧\NThat's wasn't cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.77,1:26:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我会吃掉你的心脏 夸里奇\NI will eat your heart, Quaritch.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.52,1:27:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,但你先回答我\NBut first you will answer me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.25,1:27:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你来这里有何目的？\NWhy are you here?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.27,1:27:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我特意来找你的\NI'm here for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.45,1:27:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你愿意效劳于我吗？\NYou wish to serve me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.90,1:27:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我不效劳任何人\NI don't serve anybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.55,1:27:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你\NI need you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.17,1:27:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不需要你\NBut I do not need you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.32,1:27:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,但或许我会留着你 做我的奴隶来给我解闷\NBut I might keep you as my slave to pleasure me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.57,1:27:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来挺不错 但是......\NThat sounds like a fun weekend. But...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.17,1:27:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这并非是你真正想要的\Nthat's not what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.80,1:27:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那我真正想要的是什么？\NReally what do I want?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.60,1:27:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你从未拥有过的东西\NWhat you've never had.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.77,1:27:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,同样平等\NAs equal.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.15,1:27:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你想把你的火焰蔓延至全世界\NYou want to spread your fire across the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.67,1:27:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我没说错吧？\NYeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.87,1:28:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我会给你枪械\NI'll give you guns,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.10,1:28:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我会给你通讯器\NI'll give you comms,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.10,1:28:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,火箭弹\NRPGs.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.10,1:28:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那可是威力强大的魔法\NBut that's strong magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.02,1:28:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,有了它们 你就能决战千里 如雷霆般出击 所向无敌\NCommand from a distance strike like lightning.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.12,1:28:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The clans,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.15,1:28:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那些部落\NThe clans,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.65,1:28:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你所飞及之处
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.70,1:28:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你所飞及之处\Nas far as you can fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.72,1:28:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会在洞穴前鞠躬\NThey'll bow down before burrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.30,1:28:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你想与伊娃较量吗？\NYou wanna take on Eywa.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.15,1:28:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要我\NYou need me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.12,1:28:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂你\NI see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.32,1:28:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你说得对极了\NDamn right you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.60,1:30:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,等我可以再次连接的那天\NWhen I can connect again someday.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.90,1:30:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,无论何地 我都能带你前往灵魂世界\NWherever I can be your guide in the spiritual.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.67,1:30:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那我现在就可以去吗？\NWell, can I just go now?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.57,1:30:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不 没有我可不行\NNo, not without me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.27,1:30:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,一个“天空族”的人不能突然冒出来吓唬祖先\NA Sky Person can't just show up freak out the ancestours.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.02,1:30:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他们开始前来参加幼鲲圣餐仪式了\NThey're starting to arrive for the calf's communion.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.65,1:30:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,满岁的幼鲲们还有那些新生婴儿都会聚到一块\NYearling calves and with babies together.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.72,1:30:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,与伊娃建立第一次联系\NHaving their first bond with Eywa.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.00,1:30:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,场面会很壮观\NIt'll be so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.12,1:31:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看看\NLet me see.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.85,1:31:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,蛮好看\NIt's pretty.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.45,1:31:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢的菜\NI like this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.42,1:31:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,来参加节日吧\NCome to the festival.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.10,1:31:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就在这陪你\NThen I will just stay here with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.92,1:31:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克 我本不想告诉你这件事 不过......\NLo'ak, I should not tell you this, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.77,1:31:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我的图鲲姐妹说她们一直听到帕亚坎...\NMy Tulkun sister says they have been hearing Payakan...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.72,1:31:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,...隐约呼唤他的族群\N...very faint calling to his best friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.30,1:31:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里？\NWhere?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.35,1:31:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,图鲲的歌声能在水中传播非常远 洛阿克\NTulkun's song travels very far through the water, Lo'ak.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.82,1:31:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了\NPlease.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.55,1:32:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,唉\NAi.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.40,1:32:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克\NLo'ak.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.87,1:32:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,再见了 娘\NBuy, mum.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.42,1:32:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去哪里？\NWhere are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.77,1:32:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,留步\NStop.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.02,1:32:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,有些事我得去做\NThere's something I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.67,1:32:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克！\NLo'ak!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.05,1:32:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克！\NLo'ak!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.20,1:32:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克 等等\NLo'ak, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.92,1:32:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,别走 洛阿克\NNo, Lo'ak.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.00,1:33:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我们必须找到帕亚坎 兄弟\NJa, wir mussen den Bruder von Payakan finden.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.00,1:33:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能去\NWe cannot go.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.37,1:33:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,幼鲲圣餐仪式在5天内举行\NThe calf's communion is in five days.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.10,1:33:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须去\NI have to go,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.50,1:33:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这事都怪我告诉他\NThis is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.82,1:33:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也去\NWe are going.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.97,1:33:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,大家一起带上武器和食物\NAll of us get weapons and food,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.87,1:33:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,别告诉任何人\NTell no one.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.50,1:33:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的孩子去找氏族了\NOur children have gone to clan.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.30,1:33:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你们允许的吗？\NYou let them?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.75,1:33:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是偷偷去的\NThey did not ask.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.87,1:33:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我派战士去追他们\NI will get the warriors to go after them.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.00,1:33:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不可能搜遍整个海洋\NWe cannot search the whole sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.95,1:33:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我们需要战士来守护幼鲲圣餐仪式\NWe need the warriors defend for calf's communion.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.27,1:33:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,以防恶魔船来袭\NIf the de
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.02,1:33:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,可我儿子现在孤身在外\NMy boy is out there by himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.12,1:33:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,等他有了他的下落 自然就回来了\NHe will come back when he hears it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.07,1:33:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他要走的路\NThis is his path.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.90,1:34:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧他做了什么\NLook at what he did.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.35,1:34:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克 你儿子继承了先人的智慧(血脉)\NJake, the strength of the ancestors runs in your son's veins.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.50,1:34:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这点你必须相信\NYou must trust that.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.45,1:34:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,水之道  永无止境\NThe Real Water has no beinning and no way.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.97,1:34:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,大海就是你的家园\NThe sea is your home.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.42,1:34:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,在你出生之前\NBefore your brith.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.40,1:34:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你注定是死神终结者\NYou're the Terminator of Death.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.20,1:35:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那个江湖人称“魅影骑士”的人 他在哪里？\NWhere is the one that called Toruk Makto?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.45,1:35:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,大海里面有多少鱼\NHow many fish are in the sea?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.40,1:35:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,一拍二\NOne plus two.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.22,1:35:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,天空中有多少鸟\NHow many birds are in the sky?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.02,1:35:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,一拍二拍三......\NOne plus two plus three...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.92,1:35:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉 这样\NKiri, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.79,1:35:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你请求伊娃让我再高一点\NYou could ask Eywa let me a little bit taller.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.82,1:35:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便让她把我变得更蓝些\NMaybe even a little bit more blue.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.80,1:35:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.65,1:35:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,曾几何时 我一心想着救你的命 无赖\NI was busy saving you life scoundrel.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.35,1:35:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那怕是高一点点\NJust a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.57,1:35:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,几厘米也好啊\NA couple centimeters.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.92,1:35:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,她是母神 她无所不能\NShe's the old mother, she can do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.67,1:35:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你本来就很完美 无须改变\NYou are perfect just the way you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.62,1:35:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 淘气鬼\NCome on, monkey boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.22,1:36:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,所以下一步...\NSo the next thing...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.05,1:36:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,...我要学会骑掠波翼龙\N...is I'm going to learn how to ride a Skimwing.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.35,1:36:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你可以成为一名猛士来保护我们\NSo you can become a mighty warrior to protect us.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.37,1:36:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管你个子.....\NFor all...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.92,1:36:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 狗打架不论大小\NHey, it's not the size of the dog in the fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.92,1:36:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,而是论规模\Nit's the size of the fight in the dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.60,1:36:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？\NWhat is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.60,1:36:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.67,1:36:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,跑！\NRun!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.82,1:36:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快\NGo, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.80,1:36:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛！\NSpider!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.02,1:36:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这里 混蛋\NOver here, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.60,1:36:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,来抓我啊\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.10,1:36:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 童子军\NHey, scout.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.67,1:36:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这边啊 你们这些杂碎\NThis way, you bastards.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.92,1:36:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,小心你们的狗屎\NWatch your shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.92,1:36:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,有本事来抓我\NThat's all you've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.87,1:36:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼\NShit!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.82,1:36:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我！操\NLet's me go! Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.87,1:36:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,小子 省省气吧\NBoy, save your energy.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.82,1:36:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,当心那把刀\NBe careful with that knife.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.90,1:37:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,就这点能耐\NThat's all you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.12,1:37:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,别伤到自己了\NDon't get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.62,1:37:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,空气呼吸器\NAir breather.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.95,1:37:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得飞了\NWe've to flight.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.32,1:37:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,大功告成\NBring off.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.15,1:37:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,闪电飞行\NLightning flight.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.88,1:37:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝1\NBlue one.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.65,1:37:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们出发\NLet's set off.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.52,1:37:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,图克\NTuk.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.95,1:37:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们被包围了\NThey're locking us in.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.32,1:37:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick up the weapons.\N抄起武器
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.30,1:37:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你姐姐在哪？\NWhere's your sister?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.64,1:37:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,她打水去了\NShe went for water.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.70,1:37:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉在哪里？蛛蛛呢？\NWhere's Kiri? Where's spider?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.82,1:37:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,爹\NDad.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.15,1:38:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛在哪里？\NWhere's spider?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.16,1:38:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他被捉走了\NThey took him.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.00,1:38:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那个蓝色上校捉走了他\NThe blue colonel took him.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.75,1:38:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,接住他\NCatch him.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.62,1:38:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静\NBe calm.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.05,1:38:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,别害怕\NNo fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.17,1:38:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,别害怕\NNo fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.90,1:38:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克·萨利\NJack Sully.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.82,1:38:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,带女孩们走 立刻\NThke the girls and go now.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.55,1:38:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你不走 我不会走\NI'll not go without you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.25,1:38:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不 蜘蛛已落在他们手上
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.27,1:38:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不 蜘蛛已落在他们手上\NNo, they got spider.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.55,1:38:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们再无法阻止他们\NThere's nothing holding them back.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.05,1:39:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你见识过他们的手段 再不走这些人都会没命\NYou see what they can do, these people will die.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.80,1:39:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能赶我走\NYou cannot ask this.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.82,1:39:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,丈夫 我做不到\NHusband, I cannot.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.17,1:39:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这是唯一的办法\NThis is the only way.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.30,1:39:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克·萨利......\NJake Sully...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.22,1:39:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,快滚出来\NShow yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.97,1:39:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你得走了 你得马上就走\NYou gotta go, you gotta go right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.97,1:39:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,带你妹妹去躲起来\NTake your
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.67,1:39:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,快去\NGo.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.52,1:39:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你要留下我绝不走\NIf you stay I stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.18,1:39:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,老娘要开荤 大开杀戒\NI will kill many.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.65,1:39:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不管发生任何事 你都不能开弓\NWhatever happens do not raise that bow.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.40,1:39:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你向我发誓\NYou swear to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.72,1:39:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道他就在这\NI know he's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.45,1:39:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,给他传话\NGive it to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.10,1:39:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他是梅卡伊纳人 是我们的族人\NHe is the Metkayina, he is one of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.40,1:39:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我们的人
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.42,1:39:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我们的族人\NHe's one of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.40,1:39:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,放火龙\NBurn something dragon.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.26,1:39:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,呼唤4队\NCall Team 4.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.35,1:39:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,朝第二村庄投放一些燃烧弹\NLay down some incendiary in the second village
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.57,1:39:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,收到 正在切换燃烧弹\NCopy! Switching incendiary.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.55,1:40:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杰克·萨利\NI want Jake Sully.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.47,1:40:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,停手 停手 不 不\NStop, stop, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.80,1:40:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,别开火 别开火\NHold your fire, hold your fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.75,1:40:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,快停手\NStop.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.52,1:40:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,停火\NNo fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.82,1:40:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,收到 马上执行\NCopy, bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.55,1:40:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我要走的路 兄弟\NThis is my path, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.15,1:40:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,上校\NColonel.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.15,1:40:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,下士\NCorporal.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.32,1:40:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,带我走\NTake me.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.27,1:40:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,放过我的家人和这些人\NYou leave my family and these people alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.85,1:40:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,光带你一个不够\NNot good enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.60,1:40:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你夫人也要带走\NGonna need the Mrs too.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.72,1:40:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你要的是我\NYou get me.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.72,1:40:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你俩我都要 否则我把这个地方夷为平地\NBoth of you, or I'll hammer this place flat.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.30,1:41:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,包括这里的孕妇 孩子\NPregnant ladies, kids,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.90,1:41:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我会把老太婆那副瘦骨嶙峋的小腿骨打爆 把它扔到酒桶的后面\NI'll blow grandma's skinny shin throw the back of the hooch cask.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.52,1:41:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,但我毫不在乎\NBut I just don't care.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.40,1:41:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他们只想干掉所有人 虏走你们中的侦察兵\NThey're just dying to waste everybody and take some scouts.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.80,1:41:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,来真的吗？\NReally?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.92,1:41:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们奉陪到底\NWe doing this.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.92,1:41:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,当我手臂放下来 你和你的小甜点就会小命不保\NWhen I drop my arm you and your new cupcake will die.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.22,1:41:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你会连渣不剩\NYou in particular die a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.20,1:41:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我死了 这里所有人也别想活命\NI die, everybody here dies.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.90,1:41:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,也许吧 但你想把我们杀光 可没那么容易\NMaybe, I think you can get some of us
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.15,1:41:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们的投弹手开始动手 你们的武装直升机还呆在机库里\NMaybe our bomber into action, your gunships hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.12,1:41:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们旗鼓相当 然后\NBecause we all look the same, and then,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.27,1:41:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,等你求饶的时候\Nwhen you're begging for your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.22,1:41:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我会剥了你的头皮\NI'll scalp you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.40,1:41:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的下士\NThe damm corporal,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.94,1:41:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The damm corporal,\NThe damm corporal,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.97,1:41:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的下士\NThe damm corporal,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.62,1:42:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你是真聪明还是想找死\NI don't know if you're smart or just shit nuts.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.77,1:42:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,老实说 我从来没觉得你有多聪明\NYou never struck me as all that smart.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.22,1:42:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你保证海洋之间的族人安全\NI need your word marine to marine safety for these people.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.97,1:42:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,烧了他们所有人 夸里奇\NBurn them all, Quaritch.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.35,1:42:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的达成交易吗？\NDo we have a deal?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.65,1:42:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我默认了\NDumb.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.02,1:42:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,真是头猪你发誓\NWhat a pig you swear?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.30,1:42:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,雅各布\NJacob.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.75,1:42:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.80,1:42:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,转过来\NTurn around.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.82,1:42:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\NMove.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.65,1:43:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧 快点\NLet's go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.00,1:43:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,再会 萨利夫人\NOn another time Mrs Sully.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.65,1:43:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你好运\NGood luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.02,1:44:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么发现吗？\NWhat do we got?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.12,1:44:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 我们发现了大批斑溪兽骑手闯入我们的领地\NMa'am, we have a big incursion Banshee riders inbound.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.77,1:44:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了 朝他们开火\NI see that so light them up.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.43,1:44:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,无法开火 长官 武器已被锁死\NI can't, ma'am, weapons locked out.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.20,1:44:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都有国际航空联合会徽章\NThey all have IFAF badges.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.35,1:44:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,扩展它\NExpand it.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.12,1:44:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,锁定六七个目标\NGo on six seven targets.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.05,1:44:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,给我站好 你们这些白痴\NSteht aufrecht, ihr ldioten
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.40,1:45:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不要怂\NZeigt keine Furcht.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.42,1:45:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,现在按住他\NHold on now.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.45,1:45:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,滚开！\NGet out!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.50,1:45:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧\NLet's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.20,1:45:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克\NJake.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.85,1:45:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\NHurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.60,1:45:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\NLet's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.90,1:45:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克\NJake.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.57,1:45:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克\NJake.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.87,1:45:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克\NJake.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.92,1:45:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,进去\NCome in.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.45,1:45:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,总算不辱使命 将军\NThis is your request, genera.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.72,1:45:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克·萨利 “魅影骑士”本人\NJake Sully, Toruk Makto himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.77,1:46:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你给他们分发枪械还不够\NIt's not enough for you to hand out guns.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.42,1:46:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你还把敌人带进我们的防御阵地\NYou gotta bring hostiles inside the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.40,1:46:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不太明白她意思\NGet the little.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.30,1:46:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静\NCalmness.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.50,1:46:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不是敌人 是盟友\NNot hostiles, allies.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.87,1:46:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我向您引见一下这位是芒克万族的瓦琅·扎希克\NGeneral Ardmore, I'd like you to meet Varang Zahik of the Mangkwan.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.57,1:46:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不如让我把话说得再明白点 夸里奇上校\NLet me make this very clear, colonel Quaritch.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.37,1:46:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把这些野蛮人通通护赶出我的基地\NI want every one of these savages escorted off my base a sap.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.05,1:46:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,包括你的小情人\NIncluding you little Missy over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.82,1:46:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,别犯傻了 将军\NDon't be a jackass, general.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.50,1:46:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们胜利了\NTake the win.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.00,1:46:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们有这些人\NWe got these people.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.52,1:46:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,和媒体\Nand the media.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.02,1:47:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,哇......\NWoha...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.57,1:47:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗？\NReady?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.10,1:47:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧\NLet's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.95,1:47:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,可能会有一点痛\NJust feel this a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.75,1:47:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\NHold still.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.47,1:47:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\NGood.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.60,1:47:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 看这个\NListen, look this.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.00,1:47:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,帕亚坎\NPayakan.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.47,1:48:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,帕亚坎\NPayakan.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.32,1:48:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,人们说大海能把你冲刷干净\NThe people say the sea washes you clean.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.70,1:48:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,帕亚坎\NPayakan.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.37,1:48:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-是洛阿克 -是他\N-It's Lo'ak. -It's him.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.52,1:48:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克！\NLo'ak!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.02,1:48:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,就是他\NIt's him.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.60,1:48:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克\NLo'ak.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.12,1:48:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪儿停下！\NStop over there!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.35,1:48:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克 洛阿克\NLo'ak. Lo'ak.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.65,1:48:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,提蕾娅！\NTsireya!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.65,1:48:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他们还说\NThey also say,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.97,1:48:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你有幸看到水生智慧种族——冰海天使\Nif you see the deep ones, the Clione.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.50,1:48:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的灵魂会来审判你\NTheir spirits sent to judge you.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.02,1:48:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克\NLo'ak.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.70,1:48:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,走走走\NGo, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.95,1:50:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克 洛阿克 洛阿克\NLo'ak, Lo'ak, Lo'ak.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.72,1:50:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,提蕾娅\NTsrieya.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.87,1:50:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢万灵之母\NThank you great mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.47,1:50:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 让他休息一下\NCome on, let him rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.55,1:50:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,让他松口气\NLet him go.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.77,1:50:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,做梦都没想到你们会追来\NCan't believe you guys came after me.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.60,1:50:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我朋友的路就是我的路\NMy friend's path is my path.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.85,1:50:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-这是你的鲲姐吗？-是的\N-Is this your sister? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.65,1:50:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,帕亚坎呢？她听到他了吗？\NWhat about Payakan? Does she hear him?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.72,1:50:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他就在附近 他马上就来了\NHe is close, he is coming now.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.97,1:50:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么发现吗？\NSo what you've got?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.90,1:50:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的硒元素 它寄存在他的体内\NThis is my selenium that's living inside his body.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.55,1:50:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你是说他的体内有东西？\NWait, there's something living inside of him?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.22,1:50:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,对\NYes.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.70,1:51:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一种内共生体 它以某种方法调节离子的活动......\NIt's an endosymbiont somehow moderating the ion...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.60,1:51:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,且慢\NStop.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.15,1:51:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我对它怎么工作没兴趣\NI don't need to know how it works.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.81,1:51:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我只关心我们能否克隆它\NI just need to know if we can duplicate it.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.85,1:51:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,放我出去 你个混蛋 马上！\NLet me out, you jerk, now!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.35,1:51:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经吩咐那些带手套的家伙暂时别来打扰你\NI told those rubber glove pukes to lay off you for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.90,1:51:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克在哪里？\NWhere's Jake?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.82,1:51:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他现在被关在他该呆的地方\NHe's locked up where he belongs here.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.35,1:51:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你带了汉堡包\NI brought you a burger.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.15,1:51:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,最好他别受伤\NBetter not hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.32,1:51:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他不再是你生命中的依靠\NHe's not part of your life anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.45,1:51:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在跟我在一起\NYou with me now.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.25,1:51:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你爹\NI'm your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.55,1:51:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我爹死了\NMy father is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.95,1:51:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是他的替身而已\NThis is something made up that he gave his memories here.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.47,1:51:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 不对 我还是我\NNo, no, I'm still me.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.12,1:51:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我查过了 你看\NI checked, there look.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.15,1:51:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,迈尔斯·夸里奇上校\NColonel Miles Quaritch.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.80,1:51:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我理解\NI see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.82,1:51:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们根本没有机会好好谈话\NNo way have a chance to talk too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.65,1:51:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们根本没有机会好好谈话\NNo way have a chance to talk too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.67,1:52:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们根本没有机会好好谈话\NNo way have a chance to talk too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.80,1:52:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那时候 我们一块呆在丛林里 不过......\NWhen we were out in the bush together, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.32,1:52:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我得跟你说声谢谢\NI gotta thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.60,1:52:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 是你从沉船里拖了我一把\NI mean you hauled me out of a sunken.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.00,1:52:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你救了我一命\NYou saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.75,1:52:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我当初就不该去救你\NYeah, sure wish I hadn't done that.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.77,1:52:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你说得对\NMaybe that's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.27,1:52:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,也许在你心底里并非这样想\NMaybe deep down it isn't either way.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.35,1:52:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我欠你的\NI owe you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.50,1:52:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,还有我必须.....跟你说件事\NAnd I gotta...tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.05,1:52:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计 我为你骄傲\NMan I'm proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.15,1:52:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个了不起的孩子\NYou're amazing kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.37,1:52:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,有胆识又聪明\NYou got guts, smarts.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.32,1:52:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,而且儿子 你有一颗狮子般的心\NAnd son, you got the heart of a lion.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.20,1:52:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你有我当年的风范 嗯\NI see myself in you, uh.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.80,1:52:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我实话告诉你 我了解你就像了解你妈妈一样\NI tell you I really see you, that's your mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.85,1:52:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,她嘛 嗯 很彪悍\NShe was uh... ferocious.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.95,1:52:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,难以相处\NTough to live with
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.17,1:53:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,但我爱她\NI love her.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.67,1:53:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,而伙计 你知道她爱你吗？\NAnd man did she love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.70,1:53:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你娘干过最困难的事就是那天登上武装直升机奔赴战场\NHardest thing she ever did was boarding that gunship that day going into battle.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.32,1:53:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,留下她的小宝贝\NLeaving her little baby behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.07,1:53:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你娘她是个英雄 儿子\NYour mom died a hero, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.07,1:53:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你也觉得是吧\NYou got that in you too.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.85,1:53:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何 我来这儿可不是为了打酱油的\NAnyway I didn't come down here take a trip down memoty lane.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.10,1:53:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我主要是想告诉你\NI just came by to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.47,1:53:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你需要我\NIf you need me.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.20,1:53:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我哪能不愿意\NI'm willing for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.15,1:53:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,能把它给我吗？\NCan I keep it in.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.07,1:53:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,饿了吃点东西\NEat thing when hungry.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.90,1:54:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟\NBrother.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.57,1:54:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,见到你我很高兴\NLch bin froh, dich zu sehen.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.92,1:54:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到了你 兄弟\NI see you, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.92,1:54:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？怎么了？\NWhat is it? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.60,1:54:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这是......\NEs ist...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.17,1:54:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,过得很惨\NSehr schimm.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.20,1:54:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你没找到你的族群吗？\NDidn't you find you birth clan.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.32,1:54:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了\NHabe ich.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.20,1:54:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,但只有一个人活了下来\NAber nur eine hat uberlebt.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.65,1:54:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫塔塔克\NIch bin Ta'nok.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.82,1:54:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,看看他们对我做了什么\NSeht, was sie mir angetan haben.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.00,1:54:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他们朝我开枪\NSie schossen auf mich.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.85,1:54:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,把我双眼弄瞎了\NHaben mich geblendet.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.12,1:54:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧 那些天空人对我做了些什么\NSeht, was mir die Himmelsmenschen angetan haben.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.07,1:55:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,图鲲们已陆续抵达\NTulkuns are alreacy coming in.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.47,1:55:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不过直到后天日食之后\NBut the aggregation doesn't peak until the eclipse...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.42,1:55:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...这种集合才会达到顶峰\N...which is the day after tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.42,1:55:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我们袭击的最佳时机\NThat's when we hit.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.42,1:55:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我们袭击的最佳时机
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.47,1:55:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 不行\NNo, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.07,1:55:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,接着说\NHold on, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:11.12,1:55:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 你是说要进行大规模屠杀\NNo, you're talking about wholesale slaughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.80,1:55:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,把数百人干掉 摧毁整个地区\NHundreds killed entire parts just wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.70,1:55:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,要的就是这种效果\NThat's the beauty of the idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.00,1:55:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,短短一天我们就能吹嘘一年\NWe'll feel a year's gloater in just one day.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:20.00,1:55:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这些都是有智慧的生灵\NThese are intelligent soulful beings.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.70,1:55:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你是哪位？\NWho are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.45,1:55:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,英格曼·雷因生物学家
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.47,1:55:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,英格曼·雷因生物学家\NIngerman Rein biologist.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.45,1:55:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这些生物他们有文化\NThese creatures they have culture.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:30.72,1:55:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有音乐 有他们各自的名字\NThey have music, they have names for each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.15,1:55:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这是有组织的 有目的的一场集合
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.17,1:55:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这是有组织的 有目的的一场集合\NThis is organized, this aggregation is deliberate.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.20,1:55:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一次精神聚会......\NIt's a spiritual gathering...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.55,1:55:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,放低你的架子 卡弗\NGet off your high horse, Carver.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.70,1:55:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都达成了协议\NWe all made our deals.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.95,1:55:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我拒绝报名参加这个项目\NNo, I do not sign up for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.15,1:55:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,加文博士 加文博士\NDr.Garvin, Dr.Garvin.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.57,1:55:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.30,1:55:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我记住了你的抗议\NYour protest has been noted.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.70,1:55:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-你记住了？-没错\N-Has been noted? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.12,1:55:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,潜艇小队和快艇你们从警戒线出发\NSub teams and fast boats you guys will form a cordon.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.65,1:55:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你驾驶家族车队驶到此处...\NYou drive the family groups in here...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.57,1:55:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...形成一道天然屏障 阻挡通往岛屿的去路\N...where it forms a natural choke point against the islands.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.05,1:56:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没忘记\NI haven't forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.20,1:56:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,上校 继续努力！\NColonel, work on!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.10,1:56:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,别拥挤！\NDon't crowd!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:17.65,1:56:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,武器 先生\NWeapon, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:27.75,1:56:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,结束祈祷吧 杰克\NEnd of the grace, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.77,1:56:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,明天六点正\NZero six tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.12,1:56:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,错误占据了内心\NWrong latch the heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:37.55,1:56:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,或者蹲着输\NOr lost by squat.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:41.52,1:56:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,塞尔弗里奇说这是他们更想看到的\NSelfridge says it's a better optic.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.92,1:56:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 你会成为那些权贵们的傀儡\NYes, you'll be a good dog for the suits.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.45,1:56:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是我当下关心的事\NThis isn't about now.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:54.77,1:56:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我当下关心的是我和你之间\NIt's about me and you.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:57.37,1:56:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,关于一个背叛我信任的海军陆战队员\NAbout a marine that betrayed my trust.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.70,1:57:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,关于我失去了男人和女人的事\NAbout the men and women I lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.60,1:57:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你是他的替身\NDead man's memories.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:13.22,1:57:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,迈尔斯·夸里奇不在了\NMiles Quaritch is gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.32,1:57:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在自由了\NYou're free.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.92,1:57:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And there is a world out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.95,1:57:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,外面有一个世界\NAnd there is a world out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:22.40,1:57:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这些事情 那些权贵们永远不会懂\NThese things that those suits will never understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.55,1:57:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,纳美人管它们叫“感知”\NThe Na'vi call them "kame".
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.00,1:57:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂他们那个意思\NI understand what they call it.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:32.62,1:57:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那就学着去“感知”\NThen learn to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.97,1:57:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Connect to something qreater than you...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.00,1:57:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,去接触更高级的文明...\NConnect to something qreater than you...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.62,1:57:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,...一种你无法想象的高级文明\N...greater than anything, you've ever know.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.22,1:57:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们“感知”这个世界\NLet's see this world,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.07,1:57:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,“感知”你自己\Nsee yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.55,1:57:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我感知到你了\NI see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.15,1:57:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,六点正\NIn zero six.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.07,1:58:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,上次我俘获了两个\NLast time I got tow.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.92,1:58:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们是村子里最丑的\NYeah, but they were the ugliest ones in the village.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.97,1:59:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,手放在墙上！\NHands on the wall!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.57,1:59:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,手放在墙上！\NHands on the wall!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.67,1:59:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,干得好\NDone good.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.00,1:59:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,锁起他\NLock him.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.27,1:59:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 只是想看一下你们\NIt's nothing just want to watch you guys.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.62,2:00:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样？\NWhat do you think?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:33.92,2:00:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我有博士学位 还搞不定它吗？\NOkay, you're got a PhD. How hard to me?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:42.07,2:00:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,停一下\NStop.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:42.72,2:00:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你太牛了！\NYou're so amazing!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.32,2:00:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这个！\NCheck this out！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:03.55,2:01:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？ 小美人\NWhat's up, cutie?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.05,2:01:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,她看上我了\NShe wants me.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:11.95,2:01:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 给我\NHey, hey, give me.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:17.42,2:01:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,夸里奇 夸里奇上校\NQuaritch. Colonel Quaritch.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.90,2:01:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就是火焰 敬灰烬族！\NWe are the fire, to Mangkwan!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.50,2:01:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就是火焰！干杯！\NWe are the fire! Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:32.15,2:01:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,夸里奇！\NQuaritch!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:33.10,2:01:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,夸里奇！\NQuaritch!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:34.10,2:01:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,夸里奇......\NQuaritch...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.47,2:01:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,哨子 别出声  杰克·萨利在哪里？\NMake no sound, whistle, where is Jake Sully?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.07,2:01:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的妻子都忠于她的男人\NAll wife loyal to her man.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.95,2:01:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,快说 不然我割了你\NSpeak, or I cut.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:51.77,2:01:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪？我最后问你一遍\NWhere? I will not ask again.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:58.05,2:01:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不 且慢\NNo, no, wait.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:59.40,2:02:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,别杀我\NWait.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:01.25,2:02:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,在营地里\NAt the camp.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:03.52,2:02:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他被关在一个兽笼里\NA cave where an animal.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:05.20,2:02:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,带我去\NTake me there.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.45,2:02:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,走！哪一边？\NMove! Which way?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:08.70,2:02:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 亲爱的\NHey, dear.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.95,2:02:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,追上她\NGet after her.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.04,2:02:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,别让她跑了\NDon't let her run away.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.22,2:02:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住她\NCatch her.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:44.55,2:02:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,快快快\NGo, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.57,2:02:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,驾\NRide.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.90,2:03:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么事？\NWhat happened?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.87,2:03:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克\NJake.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:20.27,2:03:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,将军？\NGeneral?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:21.52,2:03:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,现在没空 我遇到麻情了\NNot now, I have a situation.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:22.67,2:03:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 我遇到麻烦了\NNo, I have a situation.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.72,2:03:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那孩子跑了\NThe kid is loose.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:25.75,2:03:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要他活着回来\NAnd I need him back alive.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.25,2:03:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,朝她开火！\NLight her up!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.30,2:04:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,迈尔斯·索图罗 “蜘蛛”通缉公告\NMiles"Spider"Socorro C:ONTACT SEC-OPS
Dialogue: 0,2:04:30.17,2:04:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,闪开 伙计们 我要砸了它 砸了它\NOut of the way guys, move it, move it.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:37.67,2:04:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,快闪开 伙计们！\NOut of the way, Guys!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:41.25,2:04:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,快点！阻止他！\NBe quick! Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:46.77,2:04:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我要动手啦\NLet me do it.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.12,2:04:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 杰克\NGo, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:59.92,2:05:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,朝他开火！\NLight him up!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:04.47,2:05:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,倒车！\NReversing!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:09.02,2:05:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:14.82,2:05:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,火力攻击 别让他跑了！\NLight him up! Don't let him get away!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:16.95,2:05:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 他跑掉了\NYes, he has run away.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:26.75,2:05:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,安全伴我行\NSafe with me.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.45,2:05:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我在干什么？我在干什么？\NWhat am I doing? What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:58.17,2:06:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我的扩议现在还记住吗？混帐东西\NIs my protest noted now? fuckers.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:09.07,2:06:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克\NJake.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:10.35,2:06:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这边走\NThis way.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:11.82,2:06:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,走 赶紧！\NGo, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:12.75,2:06:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这边！\NThis way!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:17.75,2:06:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,雷因·加文 海洋生物学家\NRein Garvin, biologist.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.50,2:06:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:21.20,2:06:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 我得说\Nuh, I gotta say,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:22.15,2:06:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我对你的英雄事迹仰慕已久 犹如滔滔江水\NI'm a real big fan of everything you've done.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:24.80,2:06:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在努力找他们一点麻烦\NI'm working a little hard find them now.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:27.10,2:06:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就在这儿 别出声！\NWe right there. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:29.60,2:06:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么计划？\NWhat's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.15,2:06:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只能见步行步了\NThis is as far as I got.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:34.15,2:06:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说你没有计划\NBut then there's no plan.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:35.87,2:06:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,开个玩笑\NJust kidding.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.17,2:06:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.60,2:06:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,走走走\NGo, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:56.82,2:06:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么做？\NWhy are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:59.20,2:06:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna to massive Tulkun hunt the day after tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:59.22,2:07:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他们计划在后天进行一场图鲲大猎杀\NThey're gonna to massive Tulkun hunt the day after tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:04.20,2:07:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须摧毁他们所有的舰艇\NYou need to hit every ship they've got.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:06.85,2:07:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,幼鲲圣餐仪式\NThe calf's communion.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.50,2:07:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须阻止他们 只有你能够做到\NYou've got to stop them, you're the only one who can.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:14.92,2:07:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:25.85,2:07:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,萨塔 嘘......\NSata, shh...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:30.77,2:07:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧\NLet's go.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:40.57,2:07:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,走 出去！ 快 快\NGo, get out! Go, go.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:51.45,2:07:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,快 离开这儿\NGo, get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:53.39,2:07:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:54.80,2:07:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼\NWhat the fuck！
Dialogue: 0,2:08:00.82,2:08:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,利马16号 有个目标被困在一辆车后面\NLima one six, there's a subject pinned down behind a vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.75,2:08:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,目标已锁定\NThe subject has been lock.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.65,2:08:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,切换导弹干掉他\NSwitch missiles take him out.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:06.96,2:08:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,明白 导弹切换中\NGot it. Switching missiles.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:10.02,2:08:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 还记得我吗？\NHey, remember me?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:13.57,2:08:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 两匹劣马跑出来了\NThat's right, two bad horses get out.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:15.80,2:08:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我不需要这些玩意\NI don't need this shit.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:18.27,2:08:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你要干什么？\NWhat are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:19.47,2:08:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,开枪打我吗？\NDo you gonna shoot me?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:23.02,2:08:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这孩子拒绝使用空气呼吸器 他挡住了我的镜头\NThe kid can't with the air breather, he's blocking my shot.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:27.08,2:08:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,别开枪！告诉马克斯别开枪！\NDon't shoot! Tell Max not to shoot!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:30.20,2:08:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉16号 这里是蓝1\NTell one six, blue one,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:31.37,2:08:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,停止开火 盯紧16号\NHold your fire, keep visual on one six.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:34.42,2:08:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,16号停止开火！\NOne six hold your fire!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:35.52,2:08:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,在当前位置待命\NStand by at that position.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:36.87,2:08:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 你不会向我开枪的 知道为什么吗？\NYeah, you're not gonna shoot me, you know why?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:38.87,2:08:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你不行 哈哈\NBecause you can't, haha.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:40.87,2:08:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你能拿我怎样 你可以亲我的屁股\NNow you can do though, you can kiss my ass.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:44.12,2:08:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:45.27,2:08:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 杰克 快走\NCome on, Jake, go.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:46.20,2:08:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你做了什么？\NWhat did you do?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:46.95,2:08:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 走吧走吧 快点\NCome on, go, go, come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:50.70,2:08:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他正往西面移动 目标仍被锁定 但射击点被遮挡\NHe's moving west, maintain a target lock, the shot is not clear.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:55.50,2:08:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 跟着我\NHey, stay on me.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:02.57,2:09:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,跟在我身边\NStay close to me.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:04.60,2:09:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想再玩这个游戏了\NI'm not gonna play this game.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:06.02,2:09:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,利马16号 放手一搏\NLima one six take your shot.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:07.71,2:09:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,别别别 别开枪！\NNo, no, no, don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.97,2:09:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear that, hold your fire.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:10.00,2:09:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我听到了 别开火\NI hear that, hold your fire.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.00,2:09:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,快快快\NGo, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:13.35,2:09:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,利马16号......\NLima one six...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:14.43,2:09:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,利马16号 获准开火 武器自由\NLima one six, you are cleared hot, weapons free.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:16.60,2:09:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,无法锁定目标 正在调整方向\NUnable lock subject, ciming around.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:20.60,2:09:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他绕回去了\NHe's go back around.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:21.87,2:09:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这边走\NThis way.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:22.62,2:09:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是蓝1\NThis is bule one.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.82,2:09:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,检查你的火力\NCheck your fire.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:25.00,2:09:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,利马16号 你已获准开火\NLima one six, you're cleared hot.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:27.42,2:09:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,16号已就位\NOne six stand by.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:35.40,2:09:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,走开！\NGo away!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:46.10,2:09:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我的杰克 走吧\NMy Jake, go.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:47.95,2:09:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,奈蒂莉！\NNeytiri!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:50.15,2:09:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的！\NBaby!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:51.25,2:09:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道是该亲你还是骂你\NI don't know whether to kiss you or gallop you.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:54.30,2:09:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,废话少说\NYou waste time.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:56.17,2:09:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,上吧 咱们走\NCome on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:59.82,2:10:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\NLet's go!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:16.42,2:10:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,随便找个地方着陆吧\NLand anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:40.92,2:10:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我得去撒泡尿\NI gotta take a urinate.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:43.67,2:10:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你们着陆得可真及时\NYou guys landed just in time.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:46.65,2:10:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么事吗？\NWhat is it?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:48.37,2:10:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要停下来？\NWhy are we stopping?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:54.87,2:10:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这种裤子连个苍蝇都飞不进去\NThey didn't even put a fly inside
Dialogue: 0,2:10:57.02,2:10:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,真是愚蠢的设计\NThat's just dumb.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:59.40,2:11:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好主意\NGood idea.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:00.35,2:11:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,先喝水 再尿小溪里\NDrink first, then piss in this stream.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:02.47,2:11:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事 杰克？\NWhat is it, Jake?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:05.00,2:11:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我错了\NI was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:07.07,2:11:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们无法保护他\NWe can't protect him.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:10.32,2:11:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我得把这件外套脱下来\NI gotta take this stuff off.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:11.87,2:11:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,痒死了！\NIt's so itchy!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:13.95,2:11:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,夸里奇有了这个女人 无论我们身在何处 他都能找到我们\NQuaritch has this woman, she can find us wherever we go.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:19.22,2:11:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要逮捕他\NThey will get him.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:21.05,2:11:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要研究他\NThey will study him.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:23.05,2:11:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,而当人类可以呼吸这儿的空气\NAnd when humans can breathe our air.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.12,2:11:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,到那时我将会把它传播到全世界\NThen I will spread it across this world.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:30.55,2:11:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我将会毁掉森林 海洋 所有东西...\NAnd I will destroy the forests, the oceans, everything...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:33.17,2:11:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,...就像在地球上那样\N...just like on earth.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:35.50,2:11:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,到那时纳美人将不复存在\NThen the Na'vi people will be gone.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:39.42,2:11:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,图鲲也不复存在\NThe Tulkun will be gone.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:42.25,2:11:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能让这种事情发生\NAnd I can't let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:45.57,2:11:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你们饿吗？我饿死了\NAre you hungry? I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:54.37,2:11:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你是对的\NYou were right.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:00.87,2:12:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这事必须要去做\NIt has to be done.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:04.10,2:12:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克\NJake.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:07.75,2:12:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他救了你的命\NHe saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:20.62,2:12:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们别无他法\NThis is the only way.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:34.85,2:12:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛\NSpider.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:37.85,2:12:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,过来\NCome here.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:46.30,2:12:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,出什么事了？\NWhat's up?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:50.37,2:12:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？\NWhat is it?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:52.35,2:12:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,她就来\NShe's coming.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:56.42,2:12:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧\NLet's go.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:07.07,2:13:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 等一下 我们得放放水\NHey, stop for a second, we gotta take a leak.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:09.62,2:13:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,就附近吧\NJust stay close.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:19.35,2:13:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要去哪里？\NWhere are we going?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:21.17,2:13:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,安静\NBe quiet.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:38.30,2:13:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 你有什么想说的吗？\NSo do you have something to talk?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:52.45,2:13:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,过来 跑 快\NCome here, run, come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:55.57,2:13:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,看看\NLook!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:58.50,2:13:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这块石头\NThat's the one.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:01.12,2:14:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,跪在上面\NKneel on it.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:02.80,2:14:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,跪在上面\NKneel on it.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:04.10,2:14:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:04.57,2:14:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,跪在这\NKneel here.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:06.62,2:14:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了\NPlease.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:08.80,2:14:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克 拜托 停下来\NJake, please stop.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:10.72,2:14:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\NI'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:12.05,2:14:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\NDon't move.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:13.30,2:14:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托\NPlease.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:14.65,2:14:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你用不着这么做\NYou don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:18.15,2:14:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样\NPlease.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:20.12,2:14:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,万灵之母 你在吗？\NGreat mother, are you here?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:23.75,2:14:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能这么做\NYou can't to do this.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:26.05,2:14:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,指引我的手\NGuide my hands.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:27.45,2:14:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,请别这么做\NPlease don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:29.42,2:14:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,停下\NStop.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:30.90,2:14:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 停下来 拜托\NPlease, stop, please.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:33.43,2:14:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,别看着我\NDon't look at me.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:38.87,2:14:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,原谅我 儿子\NForgive me, son.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:40.80,2:14:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我会乖的\NI'll be good.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:41.55,2:14:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,愿你的灵魂归于伊娃\NMay your spirit go to Eywa.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:43.47,2:14:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证\NI promise.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:43.95,2:14:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,愿你的身体归于森林\NMay your body return to the forest.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:47.82,2:14:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,求你\NPlease.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:48.47,2:14:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,维持神圣的平衡\NTo preserve the great balance.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:51.07,2:14:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,May the ancestors welcome you.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:51.10,2:14:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,愿先人欢迎你\NMay the ancestors welcome you.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:06.00,2:15:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:10.15,2:15:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,愿先人拥抱你\NMay the ancestors hold you.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:12.72,2:15:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,愿你可唱自己的歌\NMay you sing your song.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:15.60,2:15:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 我现在就得归于伊娃\NI know I have to go to Eywa now.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:19.30,2:15:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的\NIt's okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:21.55,2:15:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,但是...\NBut...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:23.60,2:15:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,...你是否...\N...do you...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:25.70,2:15:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,...你是否还爱我？\N...do you still love me.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:29.10,2:15:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,全心全意爱你\NWith all my heart.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:14.57,2:16:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我的杰克 我的杰克\NMy Jake, my Jake.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:27.70,2:16:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到你了\NI see you.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:37.00,2:16:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,无论发生什么事 都不应该走这条路\NWhatever happens it won't be this way.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:41.70,2:16:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会找到其他路的
Dialogue: 0,2:16:41.72,2:16:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会找到其他路的\NAnd we will find another way.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:00.20,2:17:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸爸知道 在他的心里...\NMy dad knew in his heart...
Dialogue: 0,2:17:02.60,2:17:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,...通往目标的道路始终只有一条\N...there was ever one path.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:12.45,2:17:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,无论你怎么想象 他都是那样\NNo matter how you imagine himself.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:15.17,2:17:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,身为父亲\NAs a father,
Dialogue: 0,2:17:16.90,2:17:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,身为丈夫\Nas a husband,
Dialogue: 0,2:17:18.85,2:17:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,总有一天你会回来的\Nsooner or later you're back on it.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:41.60,2:17:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你好啊 老友\NHello, old friend.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:45.27,2:17:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,托鲁克也爱我爹\NToruk loved my father.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:50.37,2:17:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他知道他们共同联手才会更强大\NHe knew they were greater together.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:53.20,2:17:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,当他们起飞时 注定是一场腥风血雨\NThat when they flew there would be blood
Dialogue: 0,2:18:00.12,2:18:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他来了\NHe is coming.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:25.82,2:18:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,拜见魅影骑士！\NSee Turnk Makto!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:27.37,2:18:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,拜见！\NSee!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:30.29,2:18:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样... 请你们... 都起来吧\NNo, just... please stand...stand up.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:34.77,2:18:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,请起吧\NPlease stand up.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:36.10,2:18:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的\NBaby.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:37.47,2:18:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克\NJake.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:38.75,2:18:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,请
Dialogue: 0,2:18:38.77,2:18:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,请\NPlease.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:40.25,2:18:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 没事的\NOk, it's ok.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:44.04,2:18:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你们即刻动身 尽快前往所有的部落告知他们\NGo now, to all the clans within the days right tell them.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:51.12,2:18:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,就说魅影骑士召唤他们\NTell that Turok Makto calls to them.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:55.70,2:18:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你告诉他们\NYou tell them.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:58.64,2:19:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这一天已经到来\NThe day has come.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:39.70,2:19:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,于是战争就这样发生了\NAnd so it came to pass.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:41.70,2:19:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,魅影骑士归来了\NThe Toruk Makto returned.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:44.22,2:19:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我爹再次团结了部落\NMy father united the clans once again.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:48.35,2:19:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,发表了意义重大的演讲\NHe made the great speeches.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:50.35,2:19:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,多支箭凑在一块是无法被折断的\NMany arrows togerher cannot be broken.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:55.87,2:19:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是无法被折断的\NWe cannot be broken.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:05.65,2:20:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,但他知道只团结族人还远远不够\NBut he knew that it wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:26.42,2:20:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,伟大的族长\NGreat patriarch.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:28.17,2:20:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,智慧的长老们\NWise elders.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:31.45,2:20:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,天空人要来了\NThe sky people are coming.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:33.62,2:20:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 就在今天\NYes, today.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:35.15,2:20:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,此时此刻 他们要屠杀我们的图鲲家族\NRight now to kill our Tulkun families.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:39.50,2:20:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我恳请你们 与我们并肩作战\NI beg you, fight with us.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:51.30,2:20:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,她说：我们尊重“魅影骑士”\NShe says we respect Toruk Makto,
Dialogue: 0,2:20:55.07,2:20:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们有传统的习俗\Nbut our ways are ancient.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:01.17,2:21:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们坚信杀戮只会带来更多杀戮\NWe believe that killing will only bring more killing,
Dialogue: 0,2:21:04.57,2:21:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦开始将永无宁日\Nin an endless expanding spiral.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:10.97,2:21:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说\NHear my words.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:13.97,2:21:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,天空人绝不会善罢甘休\NThe Sky people will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:17.10,2:21:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Not until the last of the Tulkun is hunted.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:17.12,2:21:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,直到图鲲被猎杀殆尽\NNot until the last of the Tulkun is hunted.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:27.02,2:21:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克\NLo'ak.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:35.55,2:21:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我兄弟必须向议会发言\NMein Bruder muss zum Rat sprechen.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:38.37,2:21:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,帕尔坎 去吧\NPayakan! Geh!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:40.12,2:21:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是你的错\NDu darfst nicht hier sein.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:41.37,2:21:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,停下......\NStop...
Dialogue: 0,2:21:42.80,2:21:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克 你在干什么？\NLo'ak, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:43.87,2:21:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,爹......等等\NDad...wait.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:44.57,2:21:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但你不能呆在这\NBut you can't be here.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:47.37,2:21:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我是塔塔克的兄弟\NI am brother of To'nok.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:48.90,2:21:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我有权说话\NI have a right to speak.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:50.35,2:21:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克说的是事实 你必须听他说\NLo'ak speaks the truth, you must listen.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:53.75,2:21:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,提蕾娅\NTsireya.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:59.37,2:22:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,长老说他的兄弟是被驱逐者\NShe says his brother is outcast.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:02.62,2:22:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这里轮不到你说话\NYou have no standing here.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:07.27,2:22:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,要是他是被驱逐者\NIf he is outcast.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:09.42,2:22:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那我也是被驱逐者\NThen I am outcast.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:11.95,2:22:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,还有我也是被驱逐者\NAnd I am outcast.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:14.17,2:22:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,女儿 闭嘴\NDaughter, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:15.67,2:22:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:17.25,2:22:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你再也感知不到我了\NYou will never see me again.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:20.87,2:22:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,而我和我的兄弟都是被驱逐者\NAnd I and my brother are outcast.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:23.75,2:22:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,奥农\NAonung.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:25.32,2:22:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,而我们同样是被驱逐者\NAnd we are also outcast.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:40.37,2:22:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,长老说你可以发言了\NShe says you may speak.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:47.50,2:22:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,请听我说\NHear my words.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:49.17,2:22:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我兄弟本想回到他的出生部落那里去保护它\NMy brother returned to his brith clan to defend it.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:53.07,2:22:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,然而他的部落却惨遭恶魔船的灭绝\NBut his clan was wiped out by the demon ships.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:57.02,2:22:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,只有塔塔克逃过一劫\NOnly Ta'nok survived.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:59.22,2:23:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,因为她进行了反击\NBecause she fought back.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:02.17,2:23:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:20.90,2:23:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\NMy god.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:30.40,2:23:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,塔塔克说：我要替死去的母亲和死去的那些幼鲲说话\NTo'nok says, I speak for the dead mothers and the dead calves.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:42.77,2:23:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我要替我的族人和所有的灵魂说话\NI speak for my people and all our souls.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:48.25,2:23:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,永别了！\NGone forever.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:57.25,2:24:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,她说我是我们家族里幸存的瞎子目击者\NShe says I am the blind witness to our end.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:07.57,2:24:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,塔塔克说 图鲲之道必须改变\NTo'nok says, the Tulkun way must change,
Dialogue: 0,2:24:11.05,2:24:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,帕尔坎就是活生生的例子\NPayakan showed us.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:20.75,2:24:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须要反抗！\NWe must fight!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:22.90,2:24:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须反抗！\NWe must fight!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:41.97,2:24:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,长老的意思是什么？\NWhat did she say?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:43.97,2:24:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他们还没决定好\NThey will decide.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:46.72,2:24:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,看看画面中一切\NLook at all of this.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:49.35,2:24:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说他们的数量众多\NI mean there's hundreds of them look
Dialogue: 0,2:24:52.12,2:24:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这些老古董\NLook at all these old ones.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:53.85,2:24:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,老的很好\NOld is good.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:55.85,2:24:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,它们从未停止生长\NThey never stop growing.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:58.30,2:25:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说它们蕴含大量的“甘露”\NWhich means more Amrita.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:00.92,2:25:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,大家再看看这个\NLook at this one.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:02.95,2:25:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,她足足有一百米长\NShe must be a hundred meters.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:05.95,2:25:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这种作战指示怎能少了我\NYou're briefing without me.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:08.37,2:25:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为你们疏忽了\NAn oversight I assume.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:10.62,2:25:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我们并非疏忽\NNo, we're not a oversight.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:12.55,2:25:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,在你和萨利搞砸之后 你就玩完了 上校\NAfter your fiasco with Sully you're done, colonel.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:16.05,2:25:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You're confined to base pending an investigation.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:16.07,2:25:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你已被限制在基地内 等待调查\NYou're confined to base pending an investigation.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:18.70,2:25:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这永远不会困扰我 因为我需要翻身\NIt never gonna bother that I need to roll.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:21.21,2:25:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,萨利会在那里\NSully will be there.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:22.32,2:25:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说 蜘蛛同样会在那里\NWhich means that spider will be there
Dialogue: 0,2:25:24.37,2:25:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,别指望他了\NDon't look at him.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:25.42,2:25:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他的一只脚已踏进了禁闭室\NHe's one step away from the brig himself.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:27.20,2:25:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,别告诉我需要指望我\NDon't tell me, need to look at me.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:28.62,2:25:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你要干嘛？打电话给你爹？\NWhat are you gonna do? call daddy?
Dialogue: 0,2:25:30.82,2:25:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说主席吗？\NYou mean the chairman?
Dialogue: 0,2:25:32.50,2:25:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,够了\NIt's enough.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:34.17,2:25:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我仍能胜任这项任务\NI can still complete this mission.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:37.10,2:25:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧你\NLook at you.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:38.52,2:25:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你简直是你军装的耻辱！\NYou're a disgrace to your uniform!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:40.75,2:25:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,假如你还记得你的军装代表什么\NAssuming you remember what your uniform is.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:44.05,2:25:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你被禁足了！上校\NYou're grounded, colonel!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:46.05,2:25:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,无限期！\NPermanently!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:03.52,2:26:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么来这里？ 丫头\NWhy are you here, girl?
Dialogue: 0,2:26:07.22,2:26:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,祈祷 酋长\NTo pray, sheikh.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:13.55,2:26:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不 孩子\NNo, child.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:18.57,2:26:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你要来装腔作态？\NWhy did you come pose?
Dialogue: 0,2:26:23.77,2:26:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,大概你是等这个时机\NPerhaps it was for this moment.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:29.02,2:26:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,因为只有被伊娃眷顾之人才能召唤战士之母\NOnly a chosen one may call upon the warrior mother.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:38.12,2:26:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,酋长\NSheikh.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:40.22,2:26:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你在宫缩呢\NYou're having contractions.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:42.27,2:26:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我有种不祥预感......我们会葬身于这场战争\NI fear we will...we will not survive this.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:50.72,2:26:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉\NKiri.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:54.85,2:26:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说\NHear my words.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:57.57,2:27:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,或许你能为这场战争做些什么\NPerhaps something you can do.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:01.95,2:27:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你必须要做\NAnd you must do it.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:07.30,2:27:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你有一颗强大的心\NYou have a strong heart.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:10.80,2:27:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:13.00,2:27:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想去作战\NI want to fight too.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:14.47,2:27:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 这里需要你\NNo, I need you here.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:18.22,2:27:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你能保证自身安全 否则我无法答应你\NI can't do this unless I know you can keep safe.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:21.12,2:27:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,无论发生什么事你都要坚守岗位\NYou keep your post no matter what happens.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:23.70,2:27:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你理解我意思吗？\NYou read me?
Dialogue: 0,2:27:25.02,2:27:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,交给我吧 长官\NLet me try sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:33.15,2:27:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,万一爹娘有什么冬瓜豆腐\NIf your father and I do not return.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:35.35,2:27:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你就带上蜘蛛和丫头们...\NYou take spider and the girls...
Dialogue: 0,2:27:37.69,2:27:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,...走得越远越快越好\N...and you go as far and as fast as you can.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:27.82,2:28:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,靠他大爷\NHoly shit.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:33.97,2:28:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,将军 这种磁通量超出了范围\NGeneral, this flux is off the scale.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:36.85,2:28:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要远离那个恐怖的磁力\NKeep a wide radius from that flux devil,
Dialogue: 0,2:28:39.27,2:28:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,否则那东西会把你脸皮撕下来\Nthat thing will rip your face off.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:41.27,2:28:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,收到 将军 正在避开它\NReceived general, I am avoiding it.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:59.75,2:29:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 伙计们 我们先来热热身吧\NAll right, boys, let's burn some fat.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:04.12,2:29:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们上吧 放手大干\NLet's go, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:17.40,2:29:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,潜艇部队 获取网络\NDunker team, get web.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:29.17,2:29:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都准备好了吗？动手吧\NEverybody ready? Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:41.67,2:29:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,看到敌人了吗？\NSee any hostiles?
Dialogue: 0,2:29:42.97,2:29:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,没有动静\NNegative no movement.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:44.82,2:29:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这些大家伙都在忙着他们的事\NAnd the big guys are just doing their thing.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:49.82,2:29:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,鱼儿已经游进桶里了\NFish swan into the barrel.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:52.25,2:29:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,稳住\NHold.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:58.92,2:29:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,稳住\NHold.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:01.37,2:30:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,稳住\NHold.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:12.35,2:30:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住\NHang on.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:14.82,2:30:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,没见着公鲲也没见着大母鲲\NThere's no bulls and no big females.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:19.42,2:30:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,长老也没见着\NThere's no elders.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:23.02,2:30:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,别灰心 各位\NHold up, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:25.35,2:30:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 我接收到一个巨大的图鲲信号\NSir, I got a big signal to Tulkun.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:28.67,2:30:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,巨型的\NBig ones.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:30.27,2:30:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,一大群巨型的 各种各样的图鲲入境\NLots of big ones, multiple Tulkun inbound.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:46.00,2:30:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科斯比 我记得你跟我说过它们没有攻击性\NScorsby, I thought you told me they're not aggressive.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:48.97,2:30:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 他们没有\NSo, they have not.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:51.25,2:30:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,正常来说\NThat's the norm.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:53.05,2:30:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,帕亚坎 听我发令\NPayakan, ich ubernehme die Fuhrung.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:56.05,2:30:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命 酋长\NJa, Matriarchin.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:02.75,2:31:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我看不见它们了\NI lost visual.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:33.95,2:31:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 他们正在战斗\NDude, they're fighting.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:35.30,2:31:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 是啊\NYeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:01.32,2:32:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,现在\NNow.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:02.22,2:32:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,杀啊！\NKill!
Dialogue: 0,2:32:04.80,2:32:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们上！\NLet's go!
Dialogue: 0,2:32:17.25,2:32:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,杀啊！\NKill!
Dialogue: 0,2:32:24.90,2:32:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧！\NGo to hell!
Dialogue: 0,2:32:28.77,2:32:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧！\NGo to hell!
Dialogue: 0,2:32:32.20,2:32:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,当心！\NWatch out!
Dialogue: 0,2:32:55.10,2:32:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,准备武器！\NReady weapons!
Dialogue: 0,2:32:57.10,2:32:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,开火！
Dialogue: 0,2:32:57.12,2:32:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,开火！\NOpen fire!
Dialogue: 0,2:33:23.32,2:33:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,把鱼叉瞄准他们！把鱼叉瞄准他们！\NPut the harpoons at them! Put the harpoons at them!
Dialogue: 0,2:33:25.90,2:33:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,发射！\NShoot!
Dialogue: 0,2:33:29.82,2:33:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,攻击它！\NHit it!
Dialogue: 0,2:33:31.14,2:33:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,当心！
Dialogue: 0,2:33:31.16,2:33:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,当心！\NWatch out!
Dialogue: 0,2:34:04.65,2:34:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,干得好 杰克\NWell done, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:06.65,2:34:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟 兄弟
Dialogue: 0,2:34:06.68,2:34:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟 兄弟\NBro, bro.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:19.47,2:34:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 好啊\NYeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:36.35,2:34:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克！\NJake!
Dialogue: 0,2:34:41.47,2:34:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是灰烬族\NIt's the Ash.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:43.40,2:34:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,全体待命！\NAll stand by!
Dialogue: 0,2:34:44.75,2:34:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这支是我们的盟军\NThis one is our allies.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:46.75,2:34:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可能配有国际航空联合会微章\NThey might have IFAF badges.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:49.35,2:34:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,将军 感谢您给我这个将功补过的机会\NGeneral, thanks for giving me the opprtunity to contribute and achieve results.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:27.20,2:35:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:30.77,2:35:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他们赢不了了\NThey can't wim.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:33.60,2:35:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会死的\NThey will die.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:36.80,2:35:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉\NKiri.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:39.17,2:35:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-阻止她 -琪莉\N-Stop her. -Kiri.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:40.92,2:35:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉 停住\NKiri, stop.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:42.30,2:35:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉 停住 停住\NKiri, stop, stop.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:43.35,2:35:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,立刻回到避难所去\NGet back to the shelter right now.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:44.92,2:35:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿不安全\NIt's not safe here.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:45.92,2:35:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须呼唤“万灵之母‘\NI have to call the great mother.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:47.45,2:35:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你在水下这样干 会要了你小命的\NIf you do that underwater, it will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:49.34,2:35:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能这样干\NYou can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:50.35,2:35:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,图克 你不能待在外面\NTuk, you can't stay out there.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:51.57,2:35:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就走\NRight now go.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:52.85,2:35:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,回去\NGet back.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:53.82,2:35:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉 等等！\NKiri, wait!
Dialogue: 0,2:35:55.02,2:35:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,停住！ 别走\NStop！No.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:56.90,2:35:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉 停住\NKiri, stop.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:57.66,2:35:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉！\NKiri!
Dialogue: 0,2:35:59.35,2:36:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉！\NKiri!
Dialogue: 0,2:36:00.27,2:36:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉！\NKiri!
Dialogue: 0,2:36:02.12,2:36:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:02.72,2:36:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,别 等等\NNo, wait.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:04.35,2:36:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\NMy god.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:06.32,2:36:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,图克 你必须回去\NTuk, You must keep back.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:07.20,2:36:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我是认真的\NI mean it.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:08.47,2:36:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克 快点\NLo'ak, come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:10.42,2:36:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,别跟着我\NDo not follow me.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:11.65,2:36:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,快来\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:42.22,2:36:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克 他们来了\NLo'ak, they're coming.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:43.27,2:36:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我们一起战斗吧\NFight with us.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:45.27,2:36:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须保护母亲\NWir mussen die Mutter verteidigen.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:47.60,2:36:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No, 我要和她待一起\NNo, I'll stay with her.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:49.90,2:36:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:04.40,2:37:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,圣母\NHoly mother.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:06.00,2:37:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说\NHear my words.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:08.52,2:37:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,求您帮帮我们\NPlease help us.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:11.35,2:37:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉到你\NI feel you.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:13.40,2:37:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我们唯一的希望\NYou are our only hope.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:24.45,2:37:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:28.67,2:37:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了\NPlease.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:29.87,2:37:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要你\NWe need you.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:32.95,2:37:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,别不理我\NDon't push me away.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:39.55,2:37:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们希望......\NWe holp...
Dialogue: 0,2:37:41.27,2:37:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 求你 求你了\NNo, please, please.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:51.12,2:37:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 不要 不要\NNo, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:55.42,2:37:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,淘气鬼\NMonkey boy.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:56.77,2:37:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们开始吧\NLet's do this.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:58.45,2:37:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:01.92,2:38:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,加油\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:04.22,2:38:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,开火！\NFire!
Dialogue: 0,2:38:20.87,2:38:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我恳求你\NI beg you.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:22.47,2:38:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托\NPlease.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:27.12,2:38:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,别啊 求你了\NNo, please.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:29.12,2:38:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的族人正在遇难\NThe people are dying.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:39.02,2:38:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托\NPlease.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:40.17,2:38:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,别\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:42.72,2:38:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,图克\NTuk.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:43.65,2:38:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,一道......光\NOne...light.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:46.82,2:38:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以做到\NWe can do this.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:51.40,2:38:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们永不放弃\NSo we never quits.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:10.55,2:39:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,加把劲 一起走\NCome on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:12.25,2:39:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,图克\NTuk.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:13.30,2:39:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,加把劲\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:32.95,2:39:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,万灵之母\NGreat mother.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:34.27,2:39:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,救救我们吧！我们恳求您！\NHelp us! We beg you!
Dialogue: 0,2:39:37.32,2:39:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的族人正在遇难\NThe people are dying.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:41.15,2:39:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我呼唤战士之母\NI call the warrior mother.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:43.45,2:39:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,唯有您能拯救我们\NYou are only holp.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:45.87,2:40:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,开火\NFire.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:57.42,2:40:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不......\NNo...
Dialogue: 0,2:41:02.15,2:41:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,就是他 快抓住他！\NThat's him, get him!
Dialogue: 0,2:41:09.65,2:41:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,骑手们 跟我来！\NRiders, follow me!
Dialogue: 0,2:41:41.37,2:41:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,萨塔！\NSata!
Dialogue: 0,2:41:43.02,2:41:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好姑娘\NGirl girl.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:01.42,2:42:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\NYou okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:42:02.47,2:42:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,没事\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:04.45,2:42:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉呢？\NWhere's Kiri?
Dialogue: 0,2:42:11.00,2:42:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,她倒下了
Dialogue: 0,2:42:11.32,2:42:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,她倒下了\NShe came down.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:13.87,2:42:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,躲避危险\NGet to safety.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:15.52,2:42:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,别进攻了\NDo not attack.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:19.37,2:42:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们完蛋了\NWe're done.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:39.70,2:42:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,爹！\NDad!
Dialogue: 0,2:42:41.72,2:42:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克！\NLo'ak!
Dialogue: 0,2:42:42.42,2:42:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,爹！\NDad!
Dialogue: 0,2:42:43.87,2:42:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吧？\NYou okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:42:44.87,2:42:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 我扶住你了\NOkay, I got you.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:53.57,2:42:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,酋长！\NSheikh!
Dialogue: 0,2:43:07.75,2:43:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,待在这别动\NStay here.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:08.57,2:43:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我要回去找她\NI'm going bsck for her.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:09.70,2:43:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能把我一个人丢在这里\NYou can't leave me alone here.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:21.05,2:43:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,萨塔 等等\NSata, wait.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:27.30,2:43:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我快不行了\NI am dying.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:28.77,2:43:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你死不了\NNo, you can not.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:31.25,2:43:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么老是要跟我斗气\NWhy must you always argue.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:34.00,2:43:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我...我不行了\NI am...I am dying.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:36.50,2:43:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,但临死之前我要把这个孩子生下来\NBut first I will push out this baby.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:48.15,2:43:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那就使把劲\NThen push.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:52.15,2:43:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我来扶你 我扶你\NI got you, got you.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:59.22,2:44:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你要折断它\NYou need to blow it.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:00.22,2:44:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,别 行 行\NNo, don't, don't.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:02.15,2:44:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\NShit.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:02.82,2:44:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我得包扎伤口\NI gotta pack the wound.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:17.87,2:44:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,琪莉......\NKiri...
Dialogue: 0,2:44:30.02,2:44:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\NAre you OK?
Dialogue: 0,2:44:33.70,2:44:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,没事\NGood.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:36.22,2:44:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,使劲 酋长\NPush, sheikh.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:42.12,2:44:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你得再加把劲\NYou have to one more push.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:45.75,2:44:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,她出来了\NShe's coming.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:47.70,2:44:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,她出来了\NShe's coming.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:52.52,2:44:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,接过你的孩子\NPick your child.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:00.12,2:45:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:02.95,2:45:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,奈蒂莉......谢谢！\NNeytiri...thank you!
Dialogue: 0,2:45:09.60,2:45:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,她叫什么名字？\NWhat is her name?
Dialogue: 0,2:45:13.27,2:45:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,她叫布里尔\NShe...she is Brielle.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:18.55,2:45:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,她很健壮\NShe's strong.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:25.00,2:45:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,布里尔(意为上帝是我的力量)是个好名字\NBrielle is good name.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:28.22,2:45:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你会保护她吗？\NYou will protect her?
Dialogue: 0,2:45:32.00,2:45:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我会\NYes.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:56.42,2:45:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,爹 抱歉 我擅离职守了\NDad, I'm sorry I left my post.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:59.07,2:46:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 儿子\NIt's okay, son.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:00.42,2:46:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,可是......\NBut...
Dialogue: 0,2:46:01.20,2:46:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经向我证明了你的能力\NYou've proven yourself to me.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:04.52,2:46:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的是 你劝动了图鲲去反抗这件事\NI mean getting the Tulkun to fight that.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:08.67,2:46:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,就连”魅影骑士“都办不到\NEven Toruk Makto couldn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:11.32,2:46:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,而你做到了\NAnd you did it.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:13.67,2:46:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我为你感到骄傲\NI'm proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:42.85,2:46:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,编号22 你们这边的伤亡情况如何？\NTwenty two, how is your casualties?
Dialogue: 0,2:46:47.02,2:46:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,全体人员\NAll right people,
Dialogue: 0,2:46:49.37,2:46:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,请打起十二分精神\Nget ourselves together.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:51.17,2:46:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有任务未完成\NWe've still got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:53.52,2:46:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你在逗我吗？\NSeriously?
Dialogue: 0,2:46:56.62,2:46:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,海湾里有一千亿美元在等着呢\NThere's a hundred billion dollars waiting in the cove.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:59.25,2:47:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,而且没有什么能够阻挡我们\NAnd nothing standing in our way.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:03.30,2:47:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,啤酒我请客\NBeers are on me.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:06.75,2:47:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫布里尔\NYour name is Brielle.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:10.32,2:47:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你娘很强大 你以后也会和她一样强大\NYour mother was powerful, you will be powerful too.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:13.35,2:47:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,萨利夫人\NMrs. Sully.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:17.47,2:47:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:34.10,2:47:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的战利品\NIt's spoils of the war.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:36.50,2:47:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,爹\NDad.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:37.75,2:47:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,看一下\NTake a look.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:40.05,2:47:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:50.47,2:47:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在需要你\NI need you now.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:53.27,2:47:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,在我身边\NBy my side.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:55.10,2:47:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,当我的副手\NI need my wingman.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:57.62,2:47:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:58.37,2:47:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们行动吧\NLet's move out.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:12.37,2:48:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克\NJake.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:14.07,2:48:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你在这里\NI know you're out there.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:15.25,2:48:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你能听得见\NI know you can hear me.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:17.82,2:48:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,瓦琅此刻正在热情款待你的妻子\NVarang here is lighting up your wife pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:26.05,2:48:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不 娘亲\NNo, mom.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:29.22,2:48:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我令你进来 还有带上蜘蛛\NNow I want you to come in and I want you to bring spider with,
Dialogue: 0,2:48:33.15,2:48:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你收到了\Nand I konw you copy that.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:36.45,2:48:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 亲爱的\NThank you, baby.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:43.37,2:48:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,把它拉起来 搞到里面 快 快\NPick it up, get in there, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:01.20,2:49:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们被包围了\NThey're trapping us.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:02.82,2:49:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,把那些辣椒及时藏起来\NLet's get those peppers hidden in time.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:21.05,2:49:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,几百米后 给我冲进去 进入射程范围\NHundred meters, give me in there, enter the range.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:26.87,2:49:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\NShit.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:30.82,2:49:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,到那时 我们减速行驶 保持距离\NAt that point and hold slow even spacing.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:35.65,2:49:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,鱼雷分队准备就绪\NSub teams torpedoes ready up.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:38.37,2:49:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,鱼雷拦截准备\NTorpedoes herming ready.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:40.02,2:49:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,1至4号鱼雷武装\NOne to four torpedoes armed,
Dialogue: 0,2:49:41.52,2:49:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,60米处\N60 meters,
Dialogue: 0,2:49:43.35,2:49:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,目标锁定\NAim be locked.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:51.37,2:49:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,收网\NSet it closed.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:56.10,2:49:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好 开火！\NStand by, fire!
Dialogue: 0,2:50:08.77,2:50:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,图克 快看！\NTuk, Look!
Dialogue: 0,2:50:24.92,2:50:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,别开火！\NHold it fire!
Dialogue: 0,2:50:26.25,2:50:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛别开火？\NHold it fire for what?
Dialogue: 0,2:50:27.67,2:50:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得把这里情况弄清楚\NYou've to get the situation down here.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:30.20,2:50:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是伊娃觉醒了\NIt's Eywa arise.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:32.20,2:50:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,它显灵了\NIt worked.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:42.60,2:50:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧 对付那些天空之人\NGeht zu den Himmelsmenschen.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:45.87,2:50:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他们！\NTotet sie!
Dialogue: 0,2:50:47.30,2:50:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,杀光他们！\NTotet sie alle!
Dialogue: 0,2:50:54.65,2:50:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,干得好！\NGood job!
Dialogue: 0,2:50:56.40,2:50:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,带我们离开这里\NGet us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:10.22,2:51:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\NNo, no.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:18.85,2:51:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,快快快 撤离！\NGo, go, go. Evacuate!
Dialogue: 0,2:51:20.85,2:51:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的船只撤回舰船！所有船只撤回舰船！\NAll boats back to the ship! All boats back to the ship!
Dialogue: 0,2:51:26.30,2:51:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:27.72,2:51:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 精灵\NThat's right, spirit.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:05.95,2:52:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 天啊\NOh, god.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:26.97,2:52:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,带我们回基地\NGet us back to the base.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:28.00,2:52:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不行啊 推进器停了\NI can't, propulsion's down.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:08.30,2:53:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:09.32,2:53:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:10.75,2:53:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:12.35,2:53:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:16.07,2:53:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,啊......不.......\NAh...no...
Dialogue: 0,2:53:29.00,2:53:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,打起精神\NGet it up.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:32.02,2:53:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,将军！\NGeneral!
Dialogue: 0,2:53:33.77,2:53:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怖的漩涡正把我们吸进去\NFlux devils pulling us in.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:37.65,2:53:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,放弃船只！\NAband ship!
Dialogue: 0,2:53:40.02,2:53:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,放弃船只！\NAbandon ship!
Dialogue: 0,2:53:47.40,2:53:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,跟紧我\NStay close.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:59.35,2:54:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,跟紧我\NStay close.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:02.85,2:54:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,安全\NClear.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:04.95,2:54:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,安全\NClear.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:11.40,2:54:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:13.12,2:54:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人 放弃船只\NEverybody, give up the ship.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:17.95,2:54:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,朝他们开火！\NFire at them!
Dialogue: 0,2:54:19.90,2:54:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,耶\NYes.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:21.45,2:54:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要火力掩护\NI'll need cover fire, okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:23.65,2:54:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:24.50,2:54:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我会从左舷往左边走\NI'll push left down the port side,
Dialogue: 0,2:54:26.52,2:54:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,然后绕到他们的后面\Nand get around behind them.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:27.97,2:54:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,有事立刻叫我\NGet right on me.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:28.75,2:54:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,看我指挥\NJust watch me.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:29.62,2:54:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命\NYes sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:30.70,2:54:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,别射伤我们的人\NAnd don't shoot anyone you love.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:33.15,2:54:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧 去吧\NGo, go.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:46.82,2:54:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,上校 我是蜘蛛\NColonel, that's spider here.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:50.05,2:54:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,别杀他\NDon't kill him.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:54.32,2:54:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,小子 你在哪里？\NWhere are you, boy?
Dialogue: 0,2:54:55.77,2:54:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,快出来\NGet out now.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:59.02,2:55:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我这就出来\NGreat, I'll come out.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:03.22,2:55:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,给我把他们通通干掉\NKill all them for me.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:13.52,2:55:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛 听我说\NSpider, you hear me.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:16.02,2:55:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的时间不多了\NWe're running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:42.50,2:55:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我来是为了做笔交易\NI'm here to make a deal.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:46.42,2:55:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,为了他们\NThat's for them.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:48.80,2:55:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me, son.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:48.82,2:55:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来 儿子\NCome with me, son.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:50.62,2:55:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我向来牙齿当金使\NI'm a man of my word.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:52.40,2:55:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在答应你到此收手\NWe can resolve this here now.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:54.25,2:55:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,放他们回家\NEverybody goes home.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:05.90,2:56:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,全体集合 我们撤离\NCircle up, we're out of here.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:30.95,2:56:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,图克\NTuk.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:37.67,2:56:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 图克\NCome on, Tuk.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:53.95,2:56:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,离我娘远点\NLeave my mother alone.
Dialogue: 0,2:57:02.87,2:57:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋！\NBastard！
Dialogue: 0,2:57:28.97,2:57:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,走\NGo.
Dialogue: 0,2:57:31.50,2:57:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,快去找你娘\NGo find your mother.
Dialogue: 0,2:57:32.52,2:57:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,离开这艘船\NGet off the ship.
Dialogue: 0,2:57:51.05,2:57:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧 孩子\NHang on, child.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:04.55,2:58:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:10.30,2:58:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛 这里\NSpider, here.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:11.27,2:58:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克\NJake.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:11.92,2:58:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,过来\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:12.60,2:58:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼\NFuck.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:24.85,2:58:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克\NJake.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:26.00,2:58:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛\NSpider.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:28.25,2:58:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\NHey.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:39.10,2:58:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,洛阿克 走\NLo'ak, go.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:40.16,2:58:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,快快快\NGo, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,2:58:54.75,2:58:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,驾\NRide.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:07.80,2:59:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\NShit.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:17.05,2:59:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克 杰克\NJake, jake.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:38.07,2:59:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我会杀了你 我发誓\NI'll kill you, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:41.22,2:59:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你要杀你的亲爹吗？\NYou're gonna kill your own father?
Dialogue: 0,2:59:44.40,2:59:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你会死的\NYou'll die.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:45.40,2:59:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,别逼我\NDon't test me.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:49.20,2:59:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,把它给我\NGive me that.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:53.82,2:59:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个小杂碎！\NYou're a little bastard!
Dialogue: 0,2:59:58.50,2:59:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,2:59:59.17,3:00:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克 快走\NJake, come on.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:01.20,3:00:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们继续打\NLet us go on.
Dialogue: 0,3:00:08.32,3:00:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:17.95,3:01:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 该死\NOh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:39.22,3:01:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克\NJake.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:40.90,3:01:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克\NJake.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:42.42,3:01:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,啊......\NAh...
Dialogue: 0,3:01:47.75,3:01:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子！\NChild!
Dialogue: 0,3:01:51.40,3:01:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛 不\NSpider, no.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:55.65,3:01:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,紧紧抓住\NHang on.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:56.95,3:01:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:02.35,3:02:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,拉我上来\NPull me up.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:04.65,3:02:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,使劲\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:07.60,3:02:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你就不应该开枪打我的胳膊\NYou shouldn't to shot me in the arm.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:12.92,3:02:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我要放手了\NI'll let you go.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:15.17,3:02:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那就来吧\NThen do it.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:16.80,3:02:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,老爹\NDad.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:18.55,3:02:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,算你有点勇气 孩子\NYou have some courage, kid.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:21.50,3:02:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,拉我上去\NPull me up.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:46.75,3:02:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,握住我的手！\NTake my hand!
Dialogue: 0,3:02:54.97,3:02:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克\NJake.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:56.47,3:02:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,使劲\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,3:02:59.23,3:03:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没事了\NWe're fine now.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:00.62,3:03:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没事了\NWe're fine now.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:17.65,3:03:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,真的 我们差点就归西\NSo it's awkward.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:26.22,3:03:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,现在该咋办？\NNow what?
Dialogue: 0,3:03:28.12,3:03:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你要手牵手唱歌吗？\NYou're gonna hold hands and sing?
Dialogue: 0,3:03:32.65,3:03:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚学会了感知\NI learned to see.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:36.67,3:03:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你还有选择的余地\NYou have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:49.30,3:03:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\NWait!
Dialogue: 0,3:03:51.07,3:03:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\NWait.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:51.82,3:03:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\NWait.
Dialogue: 0,3:03:53.35,3:03:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 等等\NWait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:00.72,3:04:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 这就是我的选择\NThanks, this is my choice.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:28.20,3:04:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,爹 爹\NDad, dad.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:29.82,3:04:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我的杰克 坐吧\NMy Jake, sit.
Dialogue: 0,3:04:42.40,3:04:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,字幕制作：月朗风清
Dialogue: 0,3:04:49.07,3:04:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,光明终归会重现\NThe light always returns.
Dialogue: 0,3:05:02.80,3:05:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都与“万灵之母”连在一起\NWe all connect with the great mother.
Dialogue: 0,3:05:08.02,3:05:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,她心中装着所有孩子\NWho holds all her children in her heart.
Dialogue: 0,3:05:14.97,3:05:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,新生命注入无限活力\NNew life keeps the energy flowing.
Dialogue: 0,3:05:19.92,3:05:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,宛如世界的气息\NLike the breath of the world.
Dialogue: 0,3:05:24.97,3:05:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我兄弟的声音被听到了\NMy brother's voice was heard.
Dialogue: 0,3:05:28.90,3:05:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他回归了他的大家族\NHe was accepted by the clan.
Dialogue: 0,3:05:44.85,3:05:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,在灵魂世界里\NIn the spirit world,
Dialogue: 0,3:05:46.55,3:05:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们呼唤先人的力量\Nwe call upon the strength of the ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,3:05:51.95,3:05:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,回到了昔日的世界 重见了久违的先人\NAll those who have walked the path before us.
Dialogue: 0,3:06:06.60,3:06:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 猴男孩 快点\NCome on, monkey boy. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,3:06:17.57,3:06:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,3:06:19.32,3:06:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,3:06:29.20,3:06:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,看到\NSee.
Dialogue: 0,3:06:31.77,3:06:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到你了\NI see you.
Dialogue: 0,3:06:33.02,3:06:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到你了\NI see you.
Dialogue: 0,3:06:34.60,3:06:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟\NBro.
Dialogue: 0,3:06:37.30,3:06:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事\NThis is going on.
Dialogue: 0,3:06:39.65,3:06:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,见到你真高兴 老弟\NI'm happy to see you, little bro.
Dialogue: 0,3:06:42.90,3:06:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\NHey.
Dialogue: 0,3:06:44.00,3:06:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,娘亲\NMom.
Dialogue: 0,3:06:45.07,3:06:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这是蜘蛛\NThis is spider.
Dialogue: 0,3:06:47.30,3:06:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我对你了如指掌\NI've heard all about you.
Dialogue: 0,3:06:50.30,3:06:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,淘气鬼\NTroublemaker
Dialogue: 0,3:06:54.82,3:06:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你有生以来第一次体验到生命的存在\NYou are alive for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,3:06:58.12,3:07:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,而你的灵魂将与伊娃同在\NAnd your spirit will live in Eywa.
Dialogue: 0,3:07:02.37,3:07:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,到永远\NForever.
Dialogue: 0,3:07:04.92,3:07:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 你是我们家族中的一员\NYou are one of us now.
Dialogue: 0,3:07:08.25,3:07:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是我们的族人\NYou are one of the people.
Dialogue: 0,3:07:12.00,3:07:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗？\NReally?
Dialogue: 0,3:07:47.81,3:07:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,《阿凡达3：火与烬》